(3065253, 432017, 67258, '<td valign="top">You obviosly only read the title of the challenge, and not the instructions.  Disregarding that the photo doesn''t meet the challenge criteria, I think you needed a bit more work.  The snowflake isn''t readily recognisable as such - perhaps a little more detail would have helped.</td>', 'You obviosly only read the title of the challenge, and not the instructions.  Disregarding that the photo doesn''t meet the challenge criteria, I think you needed a bit more work.  The snowflake isn''t readily recognisable as such - perhaps a little more detail would have helped.', '2006-11-27 07:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065255, 432002, 67258, '<td valign="top">The white background that the challenge called for is presumably the sky? You have captured the barren vastness of the tundra well, but there isn''t enough here to compell me to carry on viewing.  The forground rocks add interest, and the far mountains bring my view back down to the wasteland, but it all seems a bit flat and uninterseting.</td>', 'The white background that the challenge called for is presumably the sky? You have captured the barren vastness of the tundra well, but there isn''t enough here to compell me to carry on viewing.  The forground rocks add interest, and the far mountains bring my view back down to the wasteland, but it all seems a bit flat and uninterseting.', '2006-11-27 07:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065257, 431886, 67258, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred the cat to be against a plain background - the dappled detail to the upper right of the frame is distracting.  You have brought out texture in the coat, but I can''t help but wonder if you have chosen to lighten the image in order to disguise burned out areas.  Nonetheless, an apt entry.</td>', 'I would have preferred the cat to be against a plain background - the dappled detail to the upper right of the frame is distracting.  You have brought out texture in the coat, but I can''t help but wonder if you have chosen to lighten the image in order to disguise burned out areas.  Nonetheless, an apt entry.', '2006-11-27 07:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065258, 432007, 14614, '<td valign="top">we had the same idea! You did a wonderful job in executing the concept</td>', 'we had the same idea! You did a wonderful job in executing the concept', '2006-11-27 07:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065259, 431992, 67258, '<td valign="top">Super detail and texture in the petals, and good exposure.  It is a shame that the tip of another flower has just made it into the bottom right hand corner of the frame.</td>', 'Super detail and texture in the petals, and good exposure.  It is a shame that the tip of another flower has just made it into the bottom right hand corner of the frame.', '2006-11-27 07:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
