(3065418, 431812, 67258, '<td valign="top">Nice action, but too over-exposed.  Also, take a little more care with framing your shot.  If you watch the swans for long enough you will learn to anticipate how they are going to behave and are more likely to be ready to make the most of the moment.</td>', 'Nice action, but too over-exposed.  Also, take a little more care with framing your shot.  If you watch the swans for long enough you will learn to anticipate how they are going to behave and are more likely to be ready to make the most of the moment.', '2006-11-27 09:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065421, 431761, 67258, '<td valign="top">A nice composition; a shame that you haven''t captured a bit more of the texture of the fresh snow.</td>', 'A nice composition; a shame that you haven''t captured a bit more of the texture of the fresh snow.', '2006-11-27 09:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
