(3065460, 432091, 53316, '<td valign="top">I really really love this concept and your execution of it except that I don''t think it suits this challenge particularly well (the feather is light on a white background but there is too much dark space in the photo I think).  But taking it apart from the challenge, this is one of the most creative and beautiful shots I have seen in a while.</td>', 'I really really love this concept and your execution of it except that I don''t think it suits this challenge particularly well (the feather is light on a white background but there is too much dark space in the photo I think).  But taking it apart from the challenge, this is one of the most creative and beautiful shots I have seen in a while.', '2006-11-27 10:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
