(3065718, 431955, 16488, '<td valign="top">Harsh shadows ruing this "study" in light, form and composition. Not much to hold my interest here.</td>', 'Harsh shadows ruing this "study" in light, form and composition. Not much to hold my interest here.', '2006-11-27 11:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065719, 431435, 24550, '<td valign="top">i dont really like the white border, but other than that, RIBBON! 9.</td>', 'i dont really like the white border, but other than that, RIBBON! 9.', '2006-11-27 11:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065720, 431758, 16488, '<td valign="top">The lighting shows off the form of the tile. As a "product shot" it fails to describe the object. As an "art" shot it fails to convey the photographer''s contribution.</td>', 'The lighting shows off the form of the tile. As a "product shot" it fails to describe the object. As an "art" shot it fails to convey the photographer''s contribution.', '2006-11-27 11:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065725, 431949, 16488, '<td valign="top">Hard to understand the subject in this image. It appears to be an inversion...but not really sure what should interest me here.</td>', 'Hard to understand the subject in this image. It appears to be an inversion...but not really sure what should interest me here.', '2006-11-27 11:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065727, 431727, 53316, '<td valign="top">I''m bad at telling between a rat and a mouse and don''t know which one this is but it is so adorable!!  I had pet mice and they were wonderful... this is a really great photo and shows so much great detail.  Good job!</td>', 'I''m bad at telling between a rat and a mouse and don''t know which one this is but it is so adorable!!  I had pet mice and they were wonderful... this is a really great photo and shows so much great detail.  Good job!', '2006-11-27 11:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065729, 431374, 16488, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the merger of the wing with the top of the frame...it feels cramped. Lighting has blown out the detail in the wing on the right and lost the other to shadow. In the end, to me, it''s a picture of someone else''s artwork and the image adds little interpretation to it.</td>', 'I don''t like the merger of the wing with the top of the frame...it feels cramped. Lighting has blown out the detail in the wing on the right and lost the other to shadow. In the end, to me, it''s a picture of someone else''s artwork and the image adds little interpretation to it.', '2006-11-27 11:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065730, 432017, 16488, '<td valign="top">Very dark image. The appeal of the fake snowflake is lost in the (lack of) lighting.</td>', 'Very dark image. The appeal of the fake snowflake is lost in the (lack of) lighting.', '2006-11-27 11:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065735, 430421, 16488, '<td valign="top">Joke is clever. Image is not.</td>', 'Joke is clever. Image is not.', '2006-11-27 11:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065736, 431659, 60173, '<td valign="top">I so wish this could win...</td>', 'I so wish this could win...', '2006-11-27 11:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065737, 431614, 16488, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t for the challenge, why would you have taken this?</td>', 'If it weren''t for the challenge, why would you have taken this?', '2006-11-27 11:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065738, 430707, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of a paper boat on a sea of milk with a mountain landscape. But your artifice is showing too much. I also think the boat needs to be in focus.</td>', 'I like the idea of a paper boat on a sea of milk with a mountain landscape. But your artifice is showing too much. I also think the boat needs to be in focus.', '2006-11-27 12:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065743, 431095, 60173, '<td valign="top">Holy pregnant momma.</td>', 'Holy pregnant momma.', '2006-11-27 12:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065751, 431087, 31443, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, what softness of light..</td>', 'Beautiful, what softness of light..', '2006-11-27 12:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065754, 431315, 16488, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering why this subject...it doesn''t seem to be an effective product shot, especially because it seems to tip without reason. Perhaps if it were tipped more? But then I would just object to the uninspired lighting.</td>', 'I''m wondering why this subject...it doesn''t seem to be an effective product shot, especially because it seems to tip without reason. Perhaps if it were tipped more? But then I would just object to the uninspired lighting.', '2006-11-27 12:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065755, 431061, 51185, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s really cool. I like it!</td>', 'Wow, that''s really cool. I like it!', '2006-11-27 12:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065756, 432088, 51185, '<td valign="top">aww what a face!</td>', 'aww what a face!', '2006-11-27 12:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065757, 431947, 16488, '<td valign="top">Funny subject that has some appeal. I don''t like that the llama is centered and think you could have cropped from the right without losing anything of interest in the image. I''d also like it better if the whites were a little stronger...the light just seems flat to me. Focus needs to be sharp around the llama''s eyes at minimum.</td>', 'Funny subject that has some appeal. I don''t like that the llama is centered and think you could have cropped from the right without losing anything of interest in the image. I''d also like it better if the whites were a little stronger...the light just seems flat to me. Focus needs to be sharp around the llama''s eyes at minimum.', '2006-11-27 12:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065760, 430887, 16488, '<td valign="top">With the harsh shadows on the inside of each wing it appears you''ve blurred out the shadows cast by the object on the background. The thing itself is an interesting piece of art but I faill to see what you''ve brought to its interpretation.</td>', 'With the harsh shadows on the inside of each wing it appears you''ve blurred out the shadows cast by the object on the background. The thing itself is an interesting piece of art but I faill to see what you''ve brought to its interpretation.', '2006-11-27 12:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065761, 431232, 16488, '<td valign="top">The soil is an unattractive orange. I hate your title. Otherwise the composition and subject had a modicum of potential.</td>', 'The soil is an unattractive orange. I hate your title. Otherwise the composition and subject had a modicum of potential.', '2006-11-27 12:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065762, 430918, 16488, '<td valign="top">The shadows compete with the form of the tiara. It also seems that this could have been more carefully composed so that the object could be enjoyed more. Not sure what all that white space does for it.</td>', 'The shadows compete with the form of the tiara. It also seems that this could have been more carefully composed so that the object could be enjoyed more. Not sure what all that white space does for it.', '2006-11-27 12:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065765, 432064, 16488, '<td valign="top">Other than a wreath of feathers, I''m not sure what this is or why I should be interested in it.</td>', 'Other than a wreath of feathers, I''m not sure what this is or why I should be interested in it.', '2006-11-27 12:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065766, 432059, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition. I think I''d like it more if there were a bit more fill lighting as the shadows seem a bit heavy without reason.</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition. I think I''d like it more if there were a bit more fill lighting as the shadows seem a bit heavy without reason.', '2006-11-27 12:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065768, 432087, 16488, '<td valign="top">The orchid merges with the background and so loses its form. I don''t like the way it merges with the frame on the right and wonder why you chose to compose it so.</td>', 'The orchid merges with the background and so loses its form. I don''t like the way it merges with the frame on the right and wonder why you chose to compose it so.', '2006-11-27 12:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065775, 431886, 16488, '<td valign="top">What keeps this from being successful, in my opinion, is the loss of detail in the brightest parts of the cat (forehead and one side of the face) as well as the lack of crispness in the eyes. Would be more appealing with a less stunned expression and some connection between subject and viewer rather than gazing out of the frame.</td>', 'What keeps this from being successful, in my opinion, is the loss of detail in the brightest parts of the cat (forehead and one side of the face) as well as the lack of crispness in the eyes. Would be more appealing with a less stunned expression and some connection between subject and viewer rather than gazing out of the frame.', '2006-11-27 12:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065778, 432018, 16488, '<td valign="top">The tones in the skin are unappealing to me. The dark wisp of hair at the edge of the face is a distraction...a slightly different angle could have eliminated that and also might have provided a more interesting curve to the side of the face.</td>', 'The tones in the skin are unappealing to me. The dark wisp of hair at the edge of the face is a distraction...a slightly different angle could have eliminated that and also might have provided a more interesting curve to the side of the face.', '2006-11-27 12:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065783, 431639, 16488, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is what hurts this most. Centering the subject creates a stagnant composition in this case especially because the subject itself has no point of interest in itself. The lighting feels flat. And the merging with the edges of the frame makes this feel uncomfortably squeezed.</td>', 'I think the composition is what hurts this most. Centering the subject creates a stagnant composition in this case especially because the subject itself has no point of interest in itself. The lighting feels flat. And the merging with the edges of the frame makes this feel uncomfortably squeezed.', '2006-11-27 12:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065785, 431659, 16488, '<td valign="top">The blue cast makes the bread look moldy. In general, I like the composition but feel some additional lighting might have made this more successful.</td>', 'The blue cast makes the bread look moldy. In general, I like the composition but feel some additional lighting might have made this more successful.', '2006-11-27 12:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065797, 431251, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the head-on pose of the bird as it feels as if it will soon fly into me. But the image lacks overall interest beyond that one facet.</td>', 'I like the head-on pose of the bird as it feels as if it will soon fly into me. But the image lacks overall interest beyond that one facet.', '2006-11-27 12:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065800, 431925, 67388, '<td valign="top">great idea, well executed story in the photo...8</td>', 'great idea, well executed story in the photo...8', '2006-11-27 12:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065809, 431790, 16488, '<td valign="top">A fair still-life study. I think the camera angle is a tad low (or is it too wide of an angle on the lens) making it feel not quite level and not quite vertical. I like repetition in form but cutting off the handle of the carafe takes away one of those repetitions. The handle of the cup frames an inconsequential part of the whole and might have been more rhythmic if it had been turned to the outside. This set up is difficult to light and keep good reflections in the surfaces--that I think you handled well.</td>', 'A fair still-life study. I think the camera angle is a tad low (or is it too wide of an angle on the lens) making it feel not quite level and not quite vertical. I like repetition in form but cutting off the handle of the carafe takes away one of those repetitions. The handle of the cup frames an inconsequential part of the whole and might have been more rhythmic if it had been turned to the outside. This set up is difficult to light and keep good reflections in the surfaces--that I think you handled well.', '2006-11-27 12:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065815, 431843, 16488, '<td valign="top">Having the background leaves and stem cut off by the frame is not a distraction but losing the most prettily lit petal to the crop is.</td>', 'Having the background leaves and stem cut off by the frame is not a distraction but losing the most prettily lit petal to the crop is.', '2006-11-27 12:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065818, 431814, 16488, '<td valign="top">Your title makes me feel like I must be missing some point you were trying to make. (Also, it''s "marguerita.")</td>', 'Your title makes me feel like I must be missing some point you were trying to make. (Also, it''s "marguerita.")', '2006-11-27 12:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065821, 431948, 16488, '<td valign="top">Some detail in the background would help this subject settle in the frame better. Yes, I see the "face" in the lichen...doesn''t compel much interest however.</td>', 'Some detail in the background would help this subject settle in the frame better. Yes, I see the "face" in the lichen...doesn''t compel much interest however.', '2006-11-27 12:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065824, 432106, 42013, '<td valign="top">Putting that WA to good use ;)</td>', 'Putting that WA to good use ;)', '2006-11-27 12:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065825, 431073, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose for this gull. Would like to see more of a background as it looks rather stark and out of context without it.</td>', 'Interesting pose for this gull. Would like to see more of a background as it looks rather stark and out of context without it.', '2006-11-27 12:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065835, 431326, 67388, '<td valign="top">great idea, accomplished the concept well...love the lights....8</td>', 'great idea, accomplished the concept well...love the lights....8', '2006-11-27 12:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
