(3065858, 431649, 67388, '<td valign="top">this is another of many great photos in this challenge...i like the sillouhette of the second lilly... nice detail <br/>8</td>', 'this is another of many great photos in this challenge...i like the sillouhette of the second lilly... nice detail 8', '2006-11-27 12:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065859, 430445, 16488, '<td valign="top">I think the subject either needs to be presented "whole" without the awkward cutting off of the blossoms at the frame or somehow a point of interest needs to be created by selecting a part of the whole. There is a beautiful arch of blossoms...but the spiral curve is interrupted.</td>', 'I think the subject either needs to be presented "whole" without the awkward cutting off of the blossoms at the frame or somehow a point of interest needs to be created by selecting a part of the whole. There is a beautiful arch of blossoms...but the spiral curve is interrupted.', '2006-11-27 12:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065860, 431861, 67388, '<td valign="top">great macro shot...i really like the shadow and the bit of dirt to contrast the white...8</td>', 'great macro shot...i really like the shadow and the bit of dirt to contrast the white...8', '2006-11-27 12:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065863, 431992, 16488, '<td valign="top">The large white border belies the greyness of the background and (especially for this challenge) should have been minimized in my opinion. The intrusive blob in the lower right corner is a distraction and more so because one of the subject''s sepals points right to it. Otherwise the subject has delicate lighting which helps show its form in a pleasing way.</td>', 'The large white border belies the greyness of the background and (especially for this challenge) should have been minimized in my opinion. The intrusive blob in the lower right corner is a distraction and more so because one of the subject''s sepals points right to it. Otherwise the subject has delicate lighting which helps show its form in a pleasing way.', '2006-11-27 12:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065864, 431073, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting ratio you''ve used here.  Was it to eliminate another bird or did you just happen to like this layout?  Not that it matters, just curious.  You have pretty good details in the seagull overall.  Seems maybe just a tad dark, although that could be because of the dark wings making it seem that way.  I like the angle the wings form in your choice of composition, and the title is cute.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting ratio you''ve used here.  Was it to eliminate another bird or did you just happen to like this layout?  Not that it matters, just curious.  You have pretty good details in the seagull overall.  Seems maybe just a tad dark, although that could be because of the dark wings making it seem that way.  I like the angle the wings form in your choice of composition, and the title is cute.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-27 12:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3065865, 431880, 67152, '<td valign="top">the washed out / blown out glass is a problem</td>', 'the washed out / blown out glass is a problem', '2006-11-27 12:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
