(3065920, 431232, 35804, '<td valign="top">...just a thought...if the dirt is not to be seen as a subject then maybe it should not be included within the image...perhaps if you had put the tiny plant in a little white vessel of some kind, thus hiding the offending dirt, the explanatory "title"/viewer intruction would not have been needed...</td>', '...just a thought...if the dirt is not to be seen as a subject then maybe it should not be included within the image...perhaps if you had put the tiny plant in a little white vessel of some kind, thus hiding the offending dirt, the explanatory "title"/viewer intruction would not have been needed...', '2006-11-27 13:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066006, 431315, 66515, '<td valign="top">The focus appears to be on the lid rather than the bottle itself. The slight tilt is a little distracting.</td>', 'The focus appears to be on the lid rather than the bottle itself. The slight tilt is a little distracting.', '2006-11-27 14:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066014, 430896, 16488, '<td valign="top">There''s really so much to like about this image! Love the handling of the light such that the texture of the white fabrics is "there" and distinct from the background. The color of the ornament helps draw attention to those lovely eyes. The skin tones are subtle and beautifully rendered. This is not just another "family photo"...it makes me want to know this child...it is as if I have just asked her a question and she is about to give me the answer. Soft and pretty! The gloves are too large for her hands, I feel, but with everything else going for it, that can be "excused" because all other intentions are so well met. Well done!</td>', 'There''s really so much to like about this image! Love the handling of the light such that the texture of the white fabrics is "there" and distinct from the background. The color of the ornament helps draw attention to those lovely eyes. The skin tones are subtle and beautifully rendered. This is not just another "family photo"...it makes me want to know this child...it is as if I have just asked her a question and she is about to give me the answer. Soft and pretty! The gloves are too large for her hands, I feel, but with everything else going for it, that can be "excused" because all other intentions are so well met. Well done!', '2006-11-27 14:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066023, 431398, 16488, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this image! It''s a wonderful sketch! The light perfectly conveys the fridged air and mood of a foggy morning. But please, please, please(!) find a way to trust your image and refrain from turning your title into a comment!</td>', 'I really enjoy this image! It''s a wonderful sketch! The light perfectly conveys the fridged air and mood of a foggy morning. But please, please, please(!) find a way to trust your image and refrain from turning your title into a comment!', '2006-11-27 14:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
