(3066102, 431720, 17990, '<td valign="top">Nice! She looks like a porcelain doll! The tones are great! Love the eyes, but in a little critique in my opinion, the light is a bit harsh in her right hand and sleeve... Anyway,I like it very much! I am giving you an 8 :) good luck</td>', 'Nice! She looks like a porcelain doll! The tones are great! Love the eyes, but in a little critique in my opinion, the light is a bit harsh in her right hand and sleeve... Anyway,I like it very much! I am giving you an 8 :) good luck', '2006-11-27 14:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
