(3066109, 430948, 53316, '<td valign="top">This would be SO awesome if it weren''t for the piercings... not having them cloned out sort of spoils, for me, an otherwise brilliant characterization.</td>', 'This would be SO awesome if it weren''t for the piercings... not having them cloned out sort of spoils, for me, an otherwise brilliant characterization.', '2006-11-27 14:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
