(3066130, 431405, 17990, '<td valign="top">Cool! I`ve seen this kind of idea somewhere else, but it doesnt take away the fact that this is a very good picture, I also like the way the nails match the fish :) Good luck! 8</td>', 'Cool! I`ve seen this kind of idea somewhere else, but it doesnt take away the fact that this is a very good picture, I also like the way the nails match the fish :) Good luck! 8', '2006-11-27 15:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066132, 431402, 53465, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2006-11-27 15:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066142, 431294, 17990, '<td valign="top">Owww! so cute!!! I think it`s a great picture! My only critique is that maybe I would like to see the right arm completely out, and I can see a dark mark next to the left arm. 8. Good Luck :)</td>', 'Owww! so cute!!! I think it`s a great picture! My only critique is that maybe I would like to see the right arm completely out, and I can see a dark mark next to the left arm. 8. Good Luck :)', '2006-11-27 15:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066147, 431435, 16488, '<td valign="top">I love the study in light in this image! The reflections, forms and tones are just appealing to me. Nothing "new" here...but it is so clean and sweet I can''t help but like it.</td>', 'I love the study in light in this image! The reflections, forms and tones are just appealing to me. Nothing "new" here...but it is so clean and sweet I can''t help but like it.', '2006-11-27 15:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066150, 431649, 53465, '<td valign="top">nice lightining</td>', 'nice lightining', '2006-11-27 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066151, 431981, 16488, '<td valign="top">A beautiful and honest portrait. I like the way you''ve handled the light. The details are perfect in their rendition. The only quibble for me would be the un-real eyes and lack of detail in the jewels...but hey, can you really have it all?</td>', 'A beautiful and honest portrait. I like the way you''ve handled the light. The details are perfect in their rendition. The only quibble for me would be the un-real eyes and lack of detail in the jewels...but hey, can you really have it all?', '2006-11-27 15:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066153, 431402, 17990, '<td valign="top">Nice! I dont know if it`s my imagination but I am watching a weird hair line up her head. Is she wearing a wig?  (I guess... that`s a lot of hair! jaja) Beautifull picture, Pretty model, I like the flowers in the hair, Good luck!</td>', 'Nice! I dont know if it`s my imagination but I am watching a weird hair line up her head. Is she wearing a wig?  (I guess... that`s a lot of hair! jaja) Beautifull picture, Pretty model, I like the flowers in the hair, Good luck!', '2006-11-27 15:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066154, 430024, 16488, '<td valign="top">Like the attitude! I think the background is a bit muddy...but only in contrast with the white border...how could that be different?</td>', 'Like the attitude! I think the background is a bit muddy...but only in contrast with the white border...how could that be different?', '2006-11-27 15:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066157, 431596, 16488, '<td valign="top">For something that''s "been done" so much, I think you''ve succeeded in capturing a lovely portrait of these daisy mums. The detail in the blossoms is pure eye-canday! Nicely handled!</td>', 'For something that''s "been done" so much, I think you''ve succeeded in capturing a lovely portrait of these daisy mums. The detail in the blossoms is pure eye-canday! Nicely handled!', '2006-11-27 15:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066162, 431992, 17990, '<td valign="top">Good picture, focus is great, I love to be able to see the detail in the rose... Only bad little thing is the "something" showing at the bottom right corner...</td>', 'Good picture, focus is great, I love to be able to see the detail in the rose... Only bad little thing is the "something" showing at the bottom right corner...', '2006-11-27 15:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066166, 431727, 16488, '<td valign="top">I love the texture in this image! The mouse seems to truly have been caught in a moment. Focus and depth of field is so perfectly coordinated in the face of the mouse! It only feels off in the blue tones of the blanket and color cast on the muzzle of the cute little creature. Nicely captured. :)</td>', 'I love the texture in this image! The mouse seems to truly have been caught in a moment. Focus and depth of field is so perfectly coordinated in the face of the mouse! It only feels off in the blue tones of the blanket and color cast on the muzzle of the cute little creature. Nicely captured. :)', '2006-11-27 15:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066169, 431549, 16488, '<td valign="top">Delicate! The petals almost disappear...but almost only. It is an image that rewards the patient viewer.</td>', 'Delicate! The petals almost disappear...but almost only. It is an image that rewards the patient viewer.', '2006-11-27 15:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066182, 431874, 17990, '<td valign="top">Magnus? I guess this is yours, and I have to admit that for the first time there is something in your picture that I dont go crazy for... I think the crop on her feet, and her right hand not showing may harm your score... Tones and lighting and great as always!</td>', 'Magnus? I guess this is yours, and I have to admit that for the first time there is something in your picture that I dont go crazy for... I think the crop on her feet, and her right hand not showing may harm your score... Tones and lighting and great as always!', '2006-11-27 15:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066184, 432041, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm .... I think I recognize the figure :)  Well done.</td>', 'Hmmmm .... I think I recognize the figure :)  Well done.', '2006-11-27 15:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3066239, 431852, 42792, '<td valign="top">Seems to be more grey on grey.</td>', 'Seems to be more grey on grey.', '2006-11-27 15:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
