(3066830, 432108, 66597, '<td valign="top">I wish the whites were whiter in this photo, because I really love the creativity and composition. I think the yellow cast is unflattering and/or distracting, however. 7.</td>', 'I wish the whites were whiter in this photo, because I really love the creativity and composition. I think the yellow cast is unflattering and/or distracting, however. 7.', '2006-11-27 19:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
