(3067421, 431640, 59215, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft photo. The texture of her skin and her hair make a nice contrast. I just wish there was a little more detail to define the shape of the torso under the right breast. It has kind of a strange floating away feeling to me- maybe a line would help, similar to the one defining the lengh of the arm. Aside from that, the composition and crop is nicely balanced.</td>', 'Beautiful soft photo. The texture of her skin and her hair make a nice contrast. I just wish there was a little more detail to define the shape of the torso under the right breast. It has kind of a strange floating away feeling to me- maybe a line would help, similar to the one defining the lengh of the arm. Aside from that, the composition and crop is nicely balanced.', '2006-11-28 00:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3067456, 431086, 64176, '<td valign="top">Exquisite!</td>', 'Exquisite!', '2006-11-28 00:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3067458, 432041, 64176, '<td valign="top">Sassy! I love it.</td>', 'Sassy! I love it.', '2006-11-28 00:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3067460, 431310, 41337, '<td valign="top">A few things are holding this back, IMO. For starters the background has "clumps" of color that I can easily see. That tells me you brighten the background a lot in post, which is fine but the execution looks a bit sloppy. Also, the hair is a bit oversharpened. The rest of her however looks fine in that regard so perhaps pixelated hair was more of a result of the resizing down to 640 pixels? Lastly, the face could use some fill lighting, which a reflector would have fixed nicely. Overall not bad. The sheen in the hair looks really good and the model is very attractive.</td>', 'A few things are holding this back, IMO. For starters the background has "clumps" of color that I can easily see. That tells me you brighten the background a lot in post, which is fine but the execution looks a bit sloppy. Also, the hair is a bit oversharpened. The rest of her however looks fine in that regard so perhaps pixelated hair was more of a result of the resizing down to 640 pixels? Lastly, the face could use some fill lighting, which a reflector would have fixed nicely. Overall not bad. The sheen in the hair looks really good and the model is very attractive.', '2006-11-28 00:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
