(3068534, 431978, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this personally, but I think your voting curve is going to end up a little polarized because soft focus is often misunderstood.  The soft focus here does two things; helps to obscure bg elements (seams, etc...) and it adds a nice dreamy look with the nice muted colors.  May not be quite white enough in your background to reach full scoring potential.  All JMO of course. :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this personally, but I think your voting curve is going to end up a little polarized because soft focus is often misunderstood.  The soft focus here does two things; helps to obscure bg elements (seams, etc...) and it adds a nice dreamy look with the nice muted colors.  May not be quite white enough in your background to reach full scoring potential.  All JMO of course. :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-28 15:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
