(3068632, 430707, 54838, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but subject OOF, poor color balance, needs a little more preparation and thinking.  B&amp;W high contrast and a different angle might have helped.</td>', 'Cute idea, but subject OOF, poor color balance, needs a little more preparation and thinking.  B&W high contrast and a different angle might have helped.', '2006-11-28 16:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
