(3068653, 431814, 54838, '<td valign="top">I like it, but it could use a bit more contrast for the harsh look or maybe a stop brighter for the "pure" look.  Nice shot!</td>', 'I like it, but it could use a bit more contrast for the harsh look or maybe a stop brighter for the "pure" look.  Nice shot!', '2006-11-28 16:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3068657, 431227, 54838, '<td valign="top">HAHA!  I get it!  Starfish!  As in "light" (star) on white?<br/>I like the tone and sharpness fall off as the starfish goes out of frame.<br/>Nice shot!</td>', 'HAHA!  I get it!  Starfish!  As in "light" (star) on white?I like the tone and sharpness fall off as the starfish goes out of frame.Nice shot!', '2006-11-28 16:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
