(3069362, 430024, 66384, '<td valign="top">Now that is outstanding! The composition, the lighting, the color, the model!</td>', 'Now that is outstanding! The composition, the lighting, the color, the model!', '2006-11-28 21:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3069369, 431547, 32872, '<td valign="top">I love your photograph and the detail/lighting is so nicely done.  The red face really stands out, as does your image!  Chickens are interesting-looking animals.</td>', 'I love your photograph and the detail/lighting is so nicely done.  The red face really stands out, as does your image!  Chickens are interesting-looking animals.', '2006-11-28 22:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3069373, 431945, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice and elegant.</td>', 'Nice and elegant.', '2006-11-28 22:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3069382, 431397, 32872, '<td valign="top">Sooo pretty. This is one of my favorites.  There''s nothing I wrong this with perfect image.</td>', 'Sooo pretty. This is one of my favorites.  There''s nothing I wrong this with perfect image.', '2006-11-28 22:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3069396, 432105, 32872, '<td valign="top">Now this is lovely.  Dang...this is so pretty!!!  Your lighting does good things to my soul!!  I know that might sound corny, but I''m being honest when I say it.  This is right up there with my favorites.</td>', 'Now this is lovely.  Dang...this is so pretty!!!  Your lighting does good things to my soul!!  I know that might sound corny, but I''m being honest when I say it.  This is right up there with my favorites.', '2006-11-28 22:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3069420, 432074, 30049, '<td valign="top">This works well.  Nice catch!  Hopefully not everyone can see this, but on my monitor I can see a fairly wide halo around the swans.  It looks like maybe the feathering area from a selection to isolate the swans for some post-processing treatment?  A few diagonal white streaks showing in the lower right area also...some branches removed maybe?  All speculation of course.  :D  Well done overall.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This works well.  Nice catch!  Hopefully not everyone can see this, but on my monitor I can see a fairly wide halo around the swans.  It looks like maybe the feathering area from a selection to isolate the swans for some post-processing treatment?  A few diagonal white streaks showing in the lower right area also...some branches removed maybe?  All speculation of course.  :D  Well done overall.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-28 22:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3069425, 429805, 32872, '<td valign="top">wow, what a nice portrait.</td>', 'wow, what a nice portrait.', '2006-11-28 22:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3069443, 431865, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok, well I guess you have light on white technically.  The lace tablecloth allows the areas under and behind to show thru which takes away from the "white" substantially.  Question for you; where did the milk come from - the milk bottle is full?  :D  The cookies at the bottom feel like an afterthought.  I think it''s because of the color and they aren''t sharp like the rest of the image (kind of seem small in comparison also).  Some big Amos cookies or something would have worked a little better IMO.  All of the above is JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok, well I guess you have light on white technically.  The lace tablecloth allows the areas under and behind to show thru which takes away from the "white" substantially.  Question for you; where did the milk come from - the milk bottle is full?  :D  The cookies at the bottom feel like an afterthought.  I think it''s because of the color and they aren''t sharp like the rest of the image (kind of seem small in comparison also).  Some big Amos cookies or something would have worked a little better IMO.  All of the above is JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-28 22:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3069447, 431906, 32872, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I love your composition and the shadows are especially lovely.  This image is also one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I love your composition and the shadows are especially lovely.  This image is also one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2006-11-28 22:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3069450, 431789, 64795, '<td valign="top">I really like the random placement of the objects, and the cupcake holders look great!</td>', 'I really like the random placement of the objects, and the cupcake holders look great!', '2006-11-28 22:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3069453, 431087, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think using words like "beauty", "lovely", "charming", etc. in the title are obvious attempts to influence the vote. This is a very lovely image, but I am taking one point of for the title.</td>', 'I think using words like "beauty", "lovely", "charming", etc. in the title are obvious attempts to influence the vote. This is a very lovely image, but I am taking one point of for the title.', '2006-11-28 22:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
