(3071432, 431892, 42495, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge and I like your composition, but doesn''t hold my interest for long.</td>', 'Meets the challenge and I like your composition, but doesn''t hold my interest for long.', '2006-11-29 10:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3071456, 431087, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice job of keeping the details of your subject and working in a white background.  It''s too bad you couldn''t keep the horses attention while taking this shot (ears are pointed back) - I know personally how challenging that can be.  :D  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice job of keeping the details of your subject and working in a white background.  It''s too bad you couldn''t keep the horses attention while taking this shot (ears are pointed back) - I know personally how challenging that can be.  :D  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-29 10:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3071464, 431549, 30049, '<td valign="top">This works "ok".  I think you lost a little bit of detail in the flower petals somewhere in the process.  Not bad, but not jumping out and saying "wow, look at this".  Hope you know what I mean by this.  Haven''t decided if I like the shadow or not.  I think it adds more than distracts because of the size of your subject in the framing of this composition.  All JMO of course.  :D  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This works "ok".  I think you lost a little bit of detail in the flower petals somewhere in the process.  Not bad, but not jumping out and saying "wow, look at this".  Hope you know what I mean by this.  Haven''t decided if I like the shadow or not.  I think it adds more than distracts because of the size of your subject in the framing of this composition.  All JMO of course.  :D  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-29 10:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3071467, 430707, 30049, '<td valign="top">???  Is this a test?  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', '???  Is this a test?  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-29 10:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3071472, 432011, 30049, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful subject and location (with the snow) for this shot.  Good detail in the dog, but you''ve not gotten the whites truly white as the snow looks beige.  Just a little tweaking with B/W points or curves and this would move up substantially IMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'What a wonderful subject and location (with the snow) for this shot.  Good detail in the dog, but you''ve not gotten the whites truly white as the snow looks beige.  Just a little tweaking with B/W points or curves and this would move up substantially IMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-29 10:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
