(3075149, 431684, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, way to go taking the "every day" and making it look so elegant and exquisite!  This is by far my favorite photo I''ve seen so far.  It''s flawless in every way:  lighting, composition, and a great seasonal subject :)!  My first 10!  I expect this one to be in the winner''s circle when it''s all said and done!</td>', 'Oh, way to go taking the "every day" and making it look so elegant and exquisite!  This is by far my favorite photo I''ve seen so far.  It''s flawless in every way:  lighting, composition, and a great seasonal subject :)!  My first 10!  I expect this one to be in the winner''s circle when it''s all said and done!', '2006-11-30 10:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
