(3076735, 430887, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in your subject (''Angel'').  The lighting is unique and helps to bring out some details.  As interesting as the angel may be, I think it''s almost a bit overpowering in filling the frame.  Sometimes filling the frame is helpful, but in this case I think people could be looking for a little more background.  The background really isn''t as white as white can be.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice detail in your subject (''Angel'').  The lighting is unique and helps to bring out some details.  As interesting as the angel may be, I think it''s almost a bit overpowering in filling the frame.  Sometimes filling the frame is helpful, but in this case I think people could be looking for a little more background.  The background really isn''t as white as white can be.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-30 21:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3076740, 432028, 30049, '<td valign="top">Going for the double I see by using an actual "Light" that''s light on white.  Only down side to this for me is that the light bulb is actually brighter (whiter) than the background.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Going for the double I see by using an actual "Light" that''s light on white.  Only down side to this for me is that the light bulb is actually brighter (whiter) than the background.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-30 21:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
