(3077093, 431294, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, priceless expression.  Those eyes and the smile are beautiful!  You and he are going to treasure this image in the future.  The background has a slight pink tinge to it, and, at least on my screen, I get a slight lighter halo around the little boy.  ~9</td>', 'Beautiful composition, priceless expression.  Those eyes and the smile are beautiful!  You and he are going to treasure this image in the future.  The background has a slight pink tinge to it, and, at least on my screen, I get a slight lighter halo around the little boy.  ~9', '2006-11-30 23:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077096, 431885, 5112, '<td valign="top">There''s something quite attractive about this image, it''s not perfect, but it''s beautiful in a strange sort of way.  I like it.  ~8</td>', 'There''s something quite attractive about this image, it''s not perfect, but it''s beautiful in a strange sort of way.  I like it.  ~8', '2006-11-30 23:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077099, 431411, 7485, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model and great feel to the image. But I actually like it better in the original orientation (looking at my screen sideways). Also, I wish there were a little more light on her eyes, both for catchlights and just to see the eyes better.</td>', 'Beautiful model and great feel to the image. But I actually like it better in the original orientation (looking at my screen sideways). Also, I wish there were a little more light on her eyes, both for catchlights and just to see the eyes better.', '2006-11-30 23:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
