(3077104, 431727, 60698, '<td valign="top">I was hoping someone would do a white mouse for this challenge. Very nice photo. It''s so hard to get the right exposure for white fur and this is just great! Like the textures here too! Adorable!</td>', 'I was hoping someone would do a white mouse for this challenge. Very nice photo. It''s so hard to get the right exposure for white fur and this is just great! Like the textures here too! Adorable!', '2006-11-30 23:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077105, 432075, 7485, '<td valign="top">Strangle creepy! But in a good way, and very good lighting and composition.</td>', 'Strangle creepy! But in a good way, and very good lighting and composition.', '2006-11-30 23:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077108, 431085, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nicely photographed.  The background is really white, although on my screen, I don''t know if it''s an illusion or not, it almost looks like a very, very, very light gradient from blueish tones at the top to pinkish tones at the bottom.  I think the image suffers from having the subject so dead centre, and also from having the subject look like it is just floating in the air, and I don''t know why or what.  Hope this helps.  ~6</td>', 'Nicely photographed.  The background is really white, although on my screen, I don''t know if it''s an illusion or not, it almost looks like a very, very, very light gradient from blueish tones at the top to pinkish tones at the bottom.  I think the image suffers from having the subject so dead centre, and also from having the subject look like it is just floating in the air, and I don''t know why or what.  Hope this helps.  ~6', '2006-11-30 23:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077110, 431874, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful!  Love those socks.<br/>Return - still love it!  ~10</td>', 'This is so beautiful!  Love those socks.Return - still love it!  ~10', '2006-11-30 23:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3077113, 431897, 5112, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful, a bit of colour and a bit of snow, on white.  You managed to keep the background very evenly white, while keeping enough contrast in the stalk/snow to not have them get lost in the background.  Good job.  ~9</td>', 'Simple and beautiful, a bit of colour and a bit of snow, on white.  You managed to keep the background very evenly white, while keeping enough contrast in the stalk/snow to not have them get lost in the background.  Good job.  ~9', '2006-11-30 23:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
