(3077154, 431398, 5112, '<td valign="top">I have seen this, not the same place, but the same look and feel, fog off water, trees lost, a little rock in the distance, hardly any colour anywhere.  A person could just sit there and dream.  It''s a very peaceful image, the balanced, centred horizon increases that feeling.  A natural light on white.  Beautiful!  ~9</td>', 'I have seen this, not the same place, but the same look and feel, fog off water, trees lost, a little rock in the distance, hardly any colour anywhere.  A person could just sit there and dream.  It''s a very peaceful image, the balanced, centred horizon increases that feeling.  A natural light on white.  Beautiful!  ~9', '2006-11-30 23:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
