(3078218, 432102, 51020, '<td valign="top">a little bit oof, but very artsy</td>', 'a little bit oof, but very artsy', '2006-12-01 07:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078220, 431326, 51020, '<td valign="top">didn''t realise there were so many whites...</td>', 'didn''t realise there were so many whites...', '2006-12-01 07:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078221, 431672, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract.</td>', 'Very nice abstract.', '2006-12-01 07:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078223, 432077, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very creative done... looks nice in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very creative done... looks nice in B&W.', '2006-12-01 07:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078226, 431981, 27524, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft portrait.</td>', 'Beautiful soft portrait.', '2006-12-01 07:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078232, 431804, 27524, '<td valign="top">Quite original... love that blure looks.</td>', 'Quite original... love that blure looks.', '2006-12-01 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078236, 431294, 27524, '<td valign="top">Great expression... nice funny image.</td>', 'Great expression... nice funny image.', '2006-12-01 07:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078258, 431761, 27524, '<td valign="top">This is lovely... nice snowy and light feeling.</td>', 'This is lovely... nice snowy and light feeling.', '2006-12-01 08:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078269, 431326, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok, you lured me in from the thumbnail...had to take a look.  :D  I like the use of the chalks here, very creative.  Great use of lighting to get the extremes on the left and base.  Almost looks like clouds or fog rolling thru your photo.  So, how''d you get them to stand up?  I used some of these once and it was a pain to keep them in place.  Used playdough on the bottom, which was fine until the playdough starting drying and hardening, then the little buggers would fall over.  In your case you''d have some serious "dominos" going on!  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok, you lured me in from the thumbnail...had to take a look.  :D  I like the use of the chalks here, very creative.  Great use of lighting to get the extremes on the left and base.  Almost looks like clouds or fog rolling thru your photo.  So, how''d you get them to stand up?  I used some of these once and it was a pain to keep them in place.  Used playdough on the bottom, which was fine until the playdough starting drying and hardening, then the little buggers would fall over.  In your case you''d have some serious "dominos" going on!  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-01 08:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078273, 430159, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is cute.  I do wish that the background was closer to white instead of beige.  Your cat is certainly curious.  Well, I guess they all are aren''t they, especially at that age.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is cute.  I do wish that the background was closer to white instead of beige.  Your cat is certainly curious.  Well, I guess they all are aren''t they, especially at that age.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-01 08:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078277, 432029, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very good details on the foreground starfish.  I understand your use of DOF to make the background shell an item of interest but not the primary.  The big thing that holds this back for me is the seam from wall to floor (back to bottom, however you want to label it...).  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Very good details on the foreground starfish.  I understand your use of DOF to make the background shell an item of interest but not the primary.  The big thing that holds this back for me is the seam from wall to floor (back to bottom, however you want to label it...).  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-01 08:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078278, 432087, 51638, '<td valign="top">The darker spots provide just enough contrast to keep this interesting.</td>', 'The darker spots provide just enough contrast to keep this interesting.', '2006-12-01 08:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078280, 432002, 51638, '<td valign="top">The foreground isn''t really all that light is it?</td>', 'The foreground isn''t really all that light is it?', '2006-12-01 08:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078281, 431941, 51638, '<td valign="top">I see the ''white'' but I''m struggling a little to find the ''light''.</td>', 'I see the ''white'' but I''m struggling a little to find the ''light''.', '2006-12-01 08:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078282, 431227, 51638, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution. I''d like to have seen a little longer DOF, but that really is only personal preference.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution. I''d like to have seen a little longer DOF, but that really is only personal preference.', '2006-12-01 08:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078286, 431241, 51638, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see just a little more definition between the glass and the background.</td>', 'I''d like to see just a little more definition between the glass and the background.', '2006-12-01 08:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078292, 431383, 51638, '<td valign="top">Nice. The small amount of contrasting darker areas set this off well.</td>', 'Nice. The small amount of contrasting darker areas set this off well.', '2006-12-01 08:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078394, 429892, 63244, '<td valign="top">Very pink tone.  Not appealing, sorry.</td>', 'Very pink tone.  Not appealing, sorry.', '2006-12-01 09:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078400, 431251, 63244, '<td valign="top">Perhaps bump up the exposure a bit when shooting or processing?  The focus is good!</td>', 'Perhaps bump up the exposure a bit when shooting or processing?  The focus is good!', '2006-12-01 09:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078412, 431947, 63244, '<td valign="top">a bit dark on the exposure.</td>', 'a bit dark on the exposure.', '2006-12-01 09:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078432, 431727, 63244, '<td valign="top">Darling little guy!  Fantastic focus.</td>', 'Darling little guy!  Fantastic focus.', '2006-12-01 09:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078605, 431241, 42495, '<td valign="top">The bulb is a bit hard to see on the background.</td>', 'The bulb is a bit hard to see on the background.', '2006-12-01 10:35:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3078709, 432056, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better flower shots I''ve seen in this challenge thus far.  I like that you added the green leaf and kept the stem as this helps to offset the white flower from the white (yes, it''s actually white - hooray!) background.  Good detail and you didn''t blow it out.  Nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is one of the better flower shots I''ve seen in this challenge thus far.  I like that you added the green leaf and kept the stem as this helps to offset the white flower from the white (yes, it''s actually white - hooray!) background.  Good detail and you didn''t blow it out.  Nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-01 11:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078719, 432094, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the yellow/green glow here.  That''s a nice touch.  The flower, especially the center, is nice and sharp.  Given the impact the center of this flower adds, I would have pushed the background to a truer white.  As is, it looks a bit dingy in comparison and takes away from the overall impact a little.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the yellow/green glow here.  That''s a nice touch.  The flower, especially the center, is nice and sharp.  Given the impact the center of this flower adds, I would have pushed the background to a truer white.  As is, it looks a bit dingy in comparison and takes away from the overall impact a little.  All JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-01 11:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078732, 431870, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a nice holiday concept type shot.  Looks very stockish (which is fine).  The lighting on the ornaments is nice and I like the blue tint.  The thing holding this back for me is that you don''t have a white background.  Why not?  It would have been fairly easy to do with the subject material you used.  Hmmm.  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice holiday concept type shot.  Looks very stockish (which is fine).  The lighting on the ornaments is nice and I like the blue tint.  The thing holding this back for me is that you don''t have a white background.  Why not?  It would have been fairly easy to do with the subject material you used.  Hmmm.  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-01 11:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078827, 431852, 42495, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you''re going for here, but I''d try to get your background more white.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you''re going for here, but I''d try to get your background more white.', '2006-12-01 11:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078833, 431625, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the petals; the center dominates the picture, IMO.</td>', 'Nice lighting on the petals; the center dominates the picture, IMO.', '2006-12-01 11:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078847, 431232, 42495, '<td valign="top">When I look at this picture the thing that draws my eye is the dirt, not the plant.  To <i>me</i>, the subject is the dirt, even if your title says otherwise.  This may have worked better if the plant dominated the picture instead of the dirt.</td>', 'When I look at this picture the thing that draws my eye is the dirt, not the plant.  To me, the subject is the dirt, even if your title says otherwise.  This may have worked better if the plant dominated the picture instead of the dirt.', '2006-12-01 11:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078878, 431822, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the flower, but the petals are whiter than the white background.</td>', 'Nice job on the flower, but the petals are whiter than the white background.', '2006-12-01 11:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078899, 431900, 42495, '<td valign="top">Good job on the colors and getting them to fade into white.</td>', 'Good job on the colors and getting them to fade into white.', '2006-12-01 11:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078975, 432106, 5112, '<td valign="top">Now this is an image with impact!  COOL!  Love it.  ~10</td>', 'Now this is an image with impact!  COOL!  Love it.  ~10', '2006-12-01 12:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078978, 430805, 5112, '<td valign="top">Great idea, wonderful expression.  I think you went a bit overboard with the NeatImaging (or equivalent) - too much detail lost.  ~6</td>', 'Great idea, wonderful expression.  I think you went a bit overboard with the NeatImaging (or equivalent) - too much detail lost.  ~6', '2006-12-01 12:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078980, 431095, 5112, '<td valign="top">Excellent maternity shot!  Love her expression, and how she''s holding the baby.  ~10</td>', 'Excellent maternity shot!  Love her expression, and how she''s holding the baby.  ~10', '2006-12-01 12:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078989, 431433, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and detail in this photo.  Nice job of getting a white background (for the most part) in place for this.  Only minor complaint I have is the composition; it would be stronger if the cat wasn''t centered, and if both ears were included.  Last, and certainly a very, very minor point - if you are going to use your pet as a subject a little extra attention to details like grooming might help a little (fur under the chin is kind of matted and would look nicer combed out).  I know, I know...it''s a cat, but still.  :D  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and detail in this photo.  Nice job of getting a white background (for the most part) in place for this.  Only minor complaint I have is the composition; it would be stronger if the cat wasn''t centered, and if both ears were included.  Last, and certainly a very, very minor point - if you are going to use your pet as a subject a little extra attention to details like grooming might help a little (fur under the chin is kind of matted and would look nicer combed out).  I know, I know...it''s a cat, but still.  :D  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-12-01 12:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3078991, 431816, 5112, '<td valign="top">Well done.  The inline complements the composition perfectly.  If there''s one detail I''d think about changing, it''s the little lamp intruding at the top right, it kind of distracts from the overall quality of the image (IMO).  Love all the shades of white in the background (and subject).  ~9</td>', 'Well done.  The inline complements the composition perfectly.  If there''s one detail I''d think about changing, it''s the little lamp intruding at the top right, it kind of distracts from the overall quality of the image (IMO).  Love all the shades of white in the background (and subject).  ~9', '2006-12-01 12:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079000, 431640, 5112, '<td valign="top">Leroy?  Quite beautiful, very soft, gentle, and yet her face looks quite earthy in a way.  Love the toning.  The earring/choker work wonders here.  I wish the right breast (the one in back) didn''t get lost quite as much into the background, makes it look abnormally small and thin compared to the rest of her.  She''s beautiful.  ~9</td>', 'Leroy?  Quite beautiful, very soft, gentle, and yet her face looks quite earthy in a way.  Love the toning.  The earring/choker work wonders here.  I wish the right breast (the one in back) didn''t get lost quite as much into the background, makes it look abnormally small and thin compared to the rest of her.  She''s beautiful.  ~9', '2006-12-01 12:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079002, 431802, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, breadmaking!  Very satisfying.  Love the flour on the hands, and how the hands really look like working hands.  ~7</td>', 'Ahhh, breadmaking!  Very satisfying.  Love the flour on the hands, and how the hands really look like working hands.  ~7', '2006-12-01 12:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079013, 431047, 5112, '<td valign="top">Is he listening to music?  Good expression.  ~7</td>', 'Is he listening to music?  Good expression.  ~7', '2006-12-01 12:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079015, 432014, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot!  <br/>Back for score -- I really like the sweep of this shot.  ~8</td>', 'This is a lovely shot!  Back for score -- I really like the sweep of this shot.  ~8', '2006-12-01 12:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079017, 431086, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, simple composition, very effective.<br/>~8</td>', 'Beautiful, simple composition, very effective.~8', '2006-12-01 12:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079022, 432011, 5112, '<td valign="top">I love the specks of snow on her fur!  ~7</td>', 'I love the specks of snow on her fur!  ~7', '2006-12-01 12:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079030, 431610, 5112, '<td valign="top">Looks like a drawing.  It really shows that you love your son here.  Wonderful image.  ~9</td>', 'Looks like a drawing.  It really shows that you love your son here.  Wonderful image.  ~9', '2006-12-01 12:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079037, 431980, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shadow!  ~7</td>', 'Beautiful shadow!  ~7', '2006-12-01 12:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079232, 432072, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice holiday theme used here.  Good attention to detail in laying this out.  Only minor complaint from me is the image in general has a bluish cast to it, like the color temp/white balance is off some.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice holiday theme used here.  Good attention to detail in laying this out.  Only minor complaint from me is the image in general has a bluish cast to it, like the color temp/white balance is off some.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-01 13:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079234, 430294, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute, I think.  It''s certainly light on white, but not a very appealing subject to use.  JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cute, I think.  It''s certainly light on white, but not a very appealing subject to use.  JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2006-12-01 13:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079243, 431624, 30049, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.  What''s the dilemma?  To use white or yellow?  Hmmm.  Oh well.  As for the image, the composition is ok, lighting is alright.  Something looks unusual in the post-processing as I''m seeing what may be alot of compression artifacts (various layers of white and yellow areas, heavy around the egg yolk and then in the upper-left corner).  Could be this cruddy monitor here at work.  :D  Anyway, just some observations and obviously JMO.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t get it.  What''s the dilemma?  To use white or yellow?  Hmmm.  Oh well.  As for the image, the composition is ok, lighting is alright.  Something looks unusual in the post-processing as I''m seeing what may be alot of compression artifacts (various layers of white and yellow areas, heavy around the egg yolk and then in the upper-left corner).  Could be this cruddy monitor here at work.  :D  Anyway, just some observations and obviously JMO.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-01 13:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079251, 432063, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  Very good details in the flower.  I may have to check out some Lilies in the future, they''re quite photogenic.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is nice.  Very good details in the flower.  I may have to check out some Lilies in the future, they''re quite photogenic.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-12-01 13:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079258, 432041, 28532, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture - great composition!  Excellent work!</td>', 'Awesome picture - great composition!  Excellent work!', '2006-12-01 13:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079268, 432008, 28532, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!!  Nicely done!</td>', 'Beautiful picture!!  Nicely done!', '2006-12-01 13:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079271, 432106, 28532, '<td valign="top">ha - love it!!!  Great shot - very creative!!</td>', 'ha - love it!!!  Great shot - very creative!!', '2006-12-01 13:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3079274, 432065, 28532, '<td valign="top">Wow - beautiful!!!  Excellent shot!</td>', 'Wow - beautiful!!!  Excellent shot!', '2006-12-01 13:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
