(3081041, 431822, 42013, '<td valign="top">NOt much not to like about this photo. My wee suggestion for improvment would be to lighten up the BG just a shade or so. Your composition and focus is great. Good work!</td>', 'NOt much not to like about this photo. My wee suggestion for improvment would be to lighten up the BG just a shade or so. Your composition and focus is great. Good work!', '2006-12-02 03:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081148, 431405, 22689, '<td valign="top">Good idea ! <br/>What I dislike in this photo : the nails , they catch the view (instead of the fishes) and the shadows on the hand because the lighting is quite good on the bulb.<br/>I don''t want to be misunderstood , I like the nails but not in this photo.</td>', 'Good idea ! What I dislike in this photo : the nails , they catch the view (instead of the fishes) and the shadows on the hand because the lighting is quite good on the bulb.I don''t want to be misunderstood , I like the nails but not in this photo.', '2006-12-02 07:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081159, 430445, 22689, '<td valign="top">I love orchids , they are so delicate , they seem so fragile.<br/>As it''s an advanced editing challenge , you could have whitened a bit more the background , it''s a little greyish and about the composition maybe the same view but not so close , two flowers are "cut".</td>', 'I love orchids , they are so delicate , they seem so fragile.As it''s an advanced editing challenge , you could have whitened a bit more the background , it''s a little greyish and about the composition maybe the same view but not so close , two flowers are "cut".', '2006-12-02 07:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081166, 432041, 61191, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... Cindi again? :) Fantastic shot, love the processing! The pantys are sexy - a bit 50''s style?. I like how the model/you holds the cloth.</td>', 'Hmmm... Cindi again? :) Fantastic shot, love the processing! The pantys are sexy - a bit 50''s style?. I like how the model/you holds the cloth.', '2006-12-02 07:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081167, 430865, 22689, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower but maybe because of the lighting or the edition the right part appears overexposed.</td>', 'Beautiful flower but maybe because of the lighting or the edition the right part appears overexposed.', '2006-12-02 07:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081170, 432017, 61191, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you heard this a 100 times: the shot doesn''t seem to match the challenge. There is no white background. The shot is VERY noisy too. Try to use tools like NeatImage (www.neatimage.com) for noise reduction.</td>', 'I''m sure you heard this a 100 times: the shot doesn''t seem to match the challenge. There is no white background. The shot is VERY noisy too. Try to use tools like NeatImage (www.neatimage.com) for noise reduction.', '2006-12-02 07:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081177, 432099, 22689, '<td valign="top">You''re in my top 5.Your photo is very nice : good composition , good focus , nice colors and even nice title !<br/>I wish you a ribbon ! Good luck</td>', 'You''re in my top 5.Your photo is very nice : good composition , good focus , nice colors and even nice title !I wish you a ribbon ! Good luck', '2006-12-02 07:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081181, 431636, 22689, '<td valign="top">Captivating and adorable are the first two words that come to my mind with your photo.<br/>Very clever idea and excellent realisation !</td>', 'Captivating and adorable are the first two words that come to my mind with your photo.Very clever idea and excellent realisation !', '2006-12-02 07:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081208, 431310, 61191, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and beautiful model but the execution lacks quality. I''ll try to give some hints:<br/>- Her skin (especially her face) suffers from artifacts. Perhaps you saved the shot in a too low qualitiy? Try to reach the 150 KB border as close as possible to guarantee the best image quality.<br/>- The image is oversharpened. Look at her hair and you will see some kind of "stairs" if you know what I mean. The hair becomes fringy and lacks smoothness. Sharpening less (especially when it comes to portraits) looks better.<br/>- The blueish spots on the background are distracting. You can easily remove them by brightening those areas up till they become white.<br/>- The most crucial point: Her face is too dark. When you look at the photo, what do you see first? Her hair, because it''s the brightest part! But the essence of every portrait is the face. This is what a viewer should see first. While taking the shot you should have used a light to brighten up her face. You can compensate this issue a bit by making the face brighter during postprocessing.<br/> <br/>Ok, this was a lot. I hope it helps :)</td>', 'Nice idea and beautiful model but the execution lacks quality. I''ll try to give some hints:- Her skin (especially her face) suffers from artifacts. Perhaps you saved the shot in a too low qualitiy? Try to reach the 150 KB border as close as possible to guarantee the best image quality.- The image is oversharpened. Look at her hair and you will see some kind of "stairs" if you know what I mean. The hair becomes fringy and lacks smoothness. Sharpening less (especially when it comes to portraits) looks better.- The blueish spots on the background are distracting. You can easily remove them by brightening those areas up till they become white.- The most crucial point: Her face is too dark. When you look at the photo, what do you see first? Her hair, because it''s the brightest part! But the essence of every portrait is the face. This is what a viewer should see first. While taking the shot you should have used a light to brighten up her face. You can compensate this issue a bit by making the face brighter during postprocessing. Ok, this was a lot. I hope it helps :)', '2006-12-02 07:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081212, 431096, 61191, '<td valign="top">Cool, I love your lighting. However I think you will get hammered because it says "mainly light colors" on white - lots of black in here. Anyway: cool shot!</td>', 'Cool, I love your lighting. However I think you will get hammered because it says "mainly light colors" on white - lots of black in here. Anyway: cool shot!', '2006-12-02 08:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081213, 432075, 61191, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, love the atmoshpere! The shadow on the left is distracting.</td>', 'Cool shot, love the atmoshpere! The shadow on the left is distracting.', '2006-12-02 08:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081218, 431756, 61191, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I don''t appreciate the green halo.</td>', 'Nice shot but I don''t appreciate the green halo.', '2006-12-02 08:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081370, 432087, 32754, '<td valign="top">the artificial plant detracts from the image</td>', 'the artificial plant detracts from the image', '2006-12-02 10:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081377, 432088, 32754, '<td valign="top">this is a good high contrast image...love the expression on your dog and composition of image...but then I am partial to Jack Russell terriers...</td>', 'this is a good high contrast image...love the expression on your dog and composition of image...but then I am partial to Jack Russell terriers...', '2006-12-02 10:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081392, 431790, 48890, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, although I think that this would look a lot better in a square crop.  The reflection of the room in the china is one big minus, and another minus is the complete removal of the background. 5</td>', 'Nice composition, although I think that this would look a lot better in a square crop.  The reflection of the room in the china is one big minus, and another minus is the complete removal of the background. 5', '2006-12-02 11:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081396, 431757, 48890, '<td valign="top">The composition isn''t working for me at all.</td>', 'The composition isn''t working for me at all.', '2006-12-02 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081399, 431405, 48890, '<td valign="top">I find this silly</td>', 'I find this silly', '2006-12-02 11:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081409, 431870, 48890, '<td valign="top">Multiple light sources of different colour temperature are quite distracting here.  Otherwise, this would make a solid stock image, nothing more.</td>', 'Multiple light sources of different colour temperature are quite distracting here.  Otherwise, this would make a solid stock image, nothing more.', '2006-12-02 11:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081437, 431086, 48890, '<td valign="top">What''s the reason for keeping the right half of the frame empty?</td>', 'What''s the reason for keeping the right half of the frame empty?', '2006-12-02 11:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081533, 431870, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail - a good stock kind of shot for the holidays.</td>', 'Very nice detail - a good stock kind of shot for the holidays.', '2006-12-02 12:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081535, 431672, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.</td>', 'Simple and effective.', '2006-12-02 12:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081544, 432049, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite a lovely presentation!</td>', 'Quite a lovely presentation!', '2006-12-02 12:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081552, 432069, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the bird.  Background is just enough to provide a nice canvas.</td>', 'Great detail on the bird.  Background is just enough to provide a nice canvas.', '2006-12-02 12:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081557, 431061, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice take on a classic shot.  Would make a nice Christmas card design.</td>', 'Nice take on a classic shot.  Would make a nice Christmas card design.', '2006-12-02 12:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081564, 431945, 30982, '<td valign="top">Another one that would make a nice Christmas card.</td>', 'Another one that would make a nice Christmas card.', '2006-12-02 12:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081568, 430451, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the general composition of this image, and it meets the challenge well.  It''s beautiful actually.  What bothers me is that it looks like it''s just floating there, no grounding.  ~8</td>', 'I like the concept and the general composition of this image, and it meets the challenge well.  It''s beautiful actually.  What bothers me is that it looks like it''s just floating there, no grounding.  ~8', '2006-12-02 12:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081569, 432065, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the way the horse is framed/cropped in this - good job at keeping the detail in the light hair, too.</td>', 'I like the way the horse is framed/cropped in this - good job at keeping the detail in the light hair, too.', '2006-12-02 12:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081581, 431995, 30982, '<td valign="top">So far, this is my favorite of the challenge - good luck!</td>', 'So far, this is my favorite of the challenge - good luck!', '2006-12-02 12:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081583, 431897, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice choice, well presented.</td>', 'Nice choice, well presented.', '2006-12-02 12:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081587, 431684, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent handling of the light and the detail.  Would make a lovely card.</td>', 'Excellent handling of the light and the detail.  Would make a lovely card.', '2006-12-02 12:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081591, 431727, 30982, '<td valign="top">Entirely too cute!  Perfect for this challenge and very well done, too.</td>', 'Entirely too cute!  Perfect for this challenge and very well done, too.', '2006-12-02 12:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081594, 431754, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great idea!!  Well executed - definitely ad-worthy.</td>', 'Great idea!!  Well executed - definitely ad-worthy.', '2006-12-02 12:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081601, 431980, 30982, '<td valign="top">A different and interesting take on a rather common subject.</td>', 'A different and interesting take on a rather common subject.', '2006-12-02 12:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081607, 431596, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  It''s so interesting what all can be done with closeup and perspective (don''t know what to call it), but the flowers look HUGE in relation to the vase, yet the was has to be bigger than the flowers (at least lenghtwise for the vase, across for the flowers).  Hmmmm.  Love the pinks and orange/yellows, so soft.  One of my favourites.  ~10</td>', 'Beautifully done.  It''s so interesting what all can be done with closeup and perspective (don''t know what to call it), but the flowers look HUGE in relation to the vase, yet the was has to be bigger than the flowers (at least lenghtwise for the vase, across for the flowers).  Hmmmm.  Love the pinks and orange/yellows, so soft.  One of my favourites.  ~10', '2006-12-02 12:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081610, 431326, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is one of those that I really quite like and can''t explain why.  I like how the ones on the left are being absorbed into the picture.</td>', 'This is one of those that I really quite like and can''t explain why.  I like how the ones on the left are being absorbed into the picture.', '2006-12-02 12:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081612, 432079, 67388, '<td valign="top">good idea, nice job</td>', 'good idea, nice job', '2006-12-02 12:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081613, 431203, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  It''s good to see a disorganized grouping of pencils :)  When first looking at this I thought, but it would be nice if the pencils were all sharp and maybe turned the same way (no lettering).  Then I thought, no, this is much more natural.  Technically excellent (the whites and the soft colours and hinted shadows).  ~8</td>', 'Very nice.  It''s good to see a disorganized grouping of pencils :)  When first looking at this I thought, but it would be nice if the pencils were all sharp and maybe turned the same way (no lettering).  Then I thought, no, this is much more natural.  Technically excellent (the whites and the soft colours and hinted shadows).  ~8', '2006-12-02 12:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081615, 430232, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  Your score with this image will probably suffer because the background is not white, but a pinkish tone.  ~7</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  Your score with this image will probably suffer because the background is not white, but a pinkish tone.  ~7', '2006-12-02 12:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081616, 431435, 30982, '<td valign="top">Common subject (''round these parts) but uncommonly well done in this case.  Nicely presented study of shape, color, and light.</td>', 'Common subject (''round these parts) but uncommonly well done in this case.  Nicely presented study of shape, color, and light.', '2006-12-02 12:58:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3081618, 432025, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well done - great detail and control of the light.</td>', 'Very well done - great detail and control of the light.', '2006-12-02 12:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081633, 431659, 5112, '<td valign="top">Top marks for punniest entry!  Now EAT IT!  Unfortunately for you, the blue cast on top of the sandwich makes it look mouldy.  ~4</td>', 'Top marks for punniest entry!  Now EAT IT!  Unfortunately for you, the blue cast on top of the sandwich makes it look mouldy.  ~4', '2006-12-02 13:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081636, 431941, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shadows.  At first I thought, where was he/she when this image was made.  Then I thought, a bridge!  Maybe, or a hill.  Hmmm.  I like it how the shapes seem to almost swirl around the large tree trunk/shadow diagonal.  ~6</td>', 'Beautiful shadows.  At first I thought, where was he/she when this image was made.  Then I thought, a bridge!  Maybe, or a hill.  Hmmm.  I like it how the shapes seem to almost swirl around the large tree trunk/shadow diagonal.  ~6', '2006-12-02 13:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081644, 432008, 67388, '<td valign="top">beautiful 10</td>', 'beautiful 10', '2006-12-02 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081646, 431096, 5112, '<td valign="top">Not exactly a "light" on white, but effective.  Interesting how the lit part of the face is to the outside of the photo.  I think it''s a good choice, I''ve been imagining it with the light side to the inside (negative space to the left) and it looks less powerful, less graphic.  ~8</td>', 'Not exactly a "light" on white, but effective.  Interesting how the lit part of the face is to the outside of the photo.  I think it''s a good choice, I''ve been imagining it with the light side to the inside (negative space to the left) and it looks less powerful, less graphic.  ~8', '2006-12-02 13:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081652, 431880, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the challenge.  To make it work, the light would have to be more controlled, so that there is definition in the glass/beer, yet the background remains very white.  As it is, the subject gets soft of mushed into the background, and the background is not clear and white.  ~4</td>', 'Good idea for the challenge.  To make it work, the light would have to be more controlled, so that there is definition in the glass/beer, yet the background remains very white.  As it is, the subject gets soft of mushed into the background, and the background is not clear and white.  ~4', '2006-12-02 13:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081671, 431704, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective in this, and the greyish tones with just a hint of colour.  I think that the crop is just a tad too tight on the long sides, the top of the chairs back is cur off just a little, as is the one edge of the seat, and I think, in this case, that doesn''t work all that well.  This would be a good shot for a "vertigo" type challenge.  ~7</td>', 'I like the perspective in this, and the greyish tones with just a hint of colour.  I think that the crop is just a tad too tight on the long sides, the top of the chairs back is cur off just a little, as is the one edge of the seat, and I think, in this case, that doesn''t work all that well.  This would be a good shot for a "vertigo" type challenge.  ~7', '2006-12-02 13:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081675, 432029, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the star and shadow.  The out of focus shell towards the back doesn''t add all that much IMHO, it maybe even confuses the image.  The horizon line (edge of table or whatever) is not straight, and it isn''t slanted enough to be intentional.  I wonder how it would be to have an image of just the star on white, with shadow (experiment with light to get the best shadow), no horizon line.  ~5</td>', 'I like the star and shadow.  The out of focus shell towards the back doesn''t add all that much IMHO, it maybe even confuses the image.  The horizon line (edge of table or whatever) is not straight, and it isn''t slanted enough to be intentional.  I wonder how it would be to have an image of just the star on white, with shadow (experiment with light to get the best shadow), no horizon line.  ~5', '2006-12-02 13:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081689, 431061, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, love the oof rounds in the back, the pinkish tones work well here.  However, IMHO the subject needs to have something clearer than it is for the image to work.  Right now the focus seems to be on the metal hanger, not the drop, and it should be on the drop I think.  IMO again, the black border hurts the image here, it makes it look heavy, and the gist of the image is light and ephimery, not heavyness.  ~5</td>', 'Beautiful, love the oof rounds in the back, the pinkish tones work well here.  However, IMHO the subject needs to have something clearer than it is for the image to work.  Right now the focus seems to be on the metal hanger, not the drop, and it should be on the drop I think.  IMO again, the black border hurts the image here, it makes it look heavy, and the gist of the image is light and ephimery, not heavyness.  ~5', '2006-12-02 13:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081711, 432093, 5112, '<td valign="top">A marbelous splash!  Well done!  Out of curiosity, (1) how many tries? (2) how do you keep any splashes off the lens?  ~9</td>', 'A marbelous splash!  Well done!  Out of curiosity, (1) how many tries? (2) how do you keep any splashes off the lens?  ~9', '2006-12-02 13:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081715, 432084, 5112, '<td valign="top">Lovely  baby image!  I like how one eye is so  much bigger than the other.  Focus is spot on.  She''s beautiful (or he?).  ~9</td>', 'Lovely  baby image!  I like how one eye is so  much bigger than the other.  Focus is spot on.  She''s beautiful (or he?).  ~9', '2006-12-02 13:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081716, 432108, 43031, '<td valign="top">that''s sliptastic!</td>', 'that''s sliptastic!', '2006-12-02 13:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081724, 431802, 43031, '<td valign="top">an inventive take on the challenge, tells a story and is nicely composed. well done, even If not cooked yet ;)</td>', 'an inventive take on the challenge, tells a story and is nicely composed. well done, even If not cooked yet ;)', '2006-12-02 13:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081729, 431817, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Well done.  ~8</td>', 'Very nice.  Well done.  ~8', '2006-12-02 13:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081733, 429846, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea, especially the concept of red on white on white.  I think this is one instance where backing off a little might be good, to give a bit of context to the subject.  The light seems to be a bit harsh on the round candle also, whereas the background, which needs more light, is grey.  ~4</td>', 'Good idea, especially the concept of red on white on white.  I think this is one instance where backing off a little might be good, to give a bit of context to the subject.  The light seems to be a bit harsh on the round candle also, whereas the background, which needs more light, is grey.  ~4', '2006-12-02 13:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081737, 431948, 5112, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Especially the light coming from the right, it''s so warm.  It looks like someone looking at the lichen, a sort of puzzled look, like, "what is that stuff?".  Love the little hairs sticking out.  ~9</td>', 'I love this.  Especially the light coming from the right, it''s so warm.  It looks like someone looking at the lichen, a sort of puzzled look, like, "what is that stuff?".  Love the little hairs sticking out.  ~9', '2006-12-02 13:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081741, 431649, 5112, '<td valign="top">They look transparent.  It is light on white.  There is something "not real" about this image, was it intentional?  I''m on the fence as to wether it works or not.  ~6</td>', 'They look transparent.  It is light on white.  There is something "not real" about this image, was it intentional?  I''m on the fence as to wether it works or not.  ~6', '2006-12-02 13:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081743, 431383, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice control of light here, pretty good focus.  IMHO it''s a bit too close, there''s no context in this image.  It''s also very centred, which increases the sense of no context.  ~6</td>', 'Nice control of light here, pretty good focus.  IMHO it''s a bit too close, there''s no context in this image.  It''s also very centred, which increases the sense of no context.  ~6', '2006-12-02 13:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081745, 431402, 5112, '<td valign="top">Yeah, definitely!  She looks like she''s having fun.  Love that smile, both in the eyes and mouth.  The shirt looks like it''s pulled up (or is that a blanket?) - I find that somewhat conterproductive here.  The definition/tones in the hair are wonderful.  ~8</td>', 'Yeah, definitely!  She looks like she''s having fun.  Love that smile, both in the eyes and mouth.  The shirt looks like it''s pulled up (or is that a blanket?) - I find that somewhat conterproductive here.  The definition/tones in the hair are wonderful.  ~8', '2006-12-02 13:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081755, 431397, 5112, '<td valign="top">Well done!  I like the transparent quality of this image, and how the vase seems to get lost into space.  Lovely touch of pink.  I''m not quite as sure about the centredness of the image, I wonder if placing the subject a bit more to one side would also work.  ~8</td>', 'Well done!  I like the transparent quality of this image, and how the vase seems to get lost into space.  Lovely touch of pink.  I''m not quite as sure about the centredness of the image, I wonder if placing the subject a bit more to one side would also work.  ~8', '2006-12-02 13:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081758, 431666, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pattern of shadows/subject.  I like the sparkles.  However, it doesn''t really give the impression of a light on white image.  ~5</td>', 'Beautiful pattern of shadows/subject.  I like the sparkles.  However, it doesn''t really give the impression of a light on white image.  ~5', '2006-12-02 13:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081761, 431362, 5112, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clean, well done.  However, I think what might be missing is some sort of connection to the viewer besides recognition (oh, yes, it''s earbuds).  I like the "L" - that helps a bit with making a connection.  ~7</td>', 'Crisp, clean, well done.  However, I think what might be missing is some sort of connection to the viewer besides recognition (oh, yes, it''s earbuds).  I like the "L" - that helps a bit with making a connection.  ~7', '2006-12-02 13:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081768, 431012, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  If anything, I think the face looks just a bit blurry, and it would be good to have the face sharp.  ~7</td>', 'I like this image.  If anything, I think the face looks just a bit blurry, and it would be good to have the face sharp.  ~7', '2006-12-02 14:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081772, 431761, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh!  this is beautiful!  Perfect in my book.  ~10</td>', 'Ahhhh!  this is beautiful!  Perfect in my book.  ~10', '2006-12-02 14:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081773, 432099, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light on the daisy, great definition.  Not sure if the squarish (not square, duh!) crop complements the image.  I also think the yellow border doens''t work all that well, it takes away from the lightness of the flower on the shite background.  <br/> <br/>Thinking about the border, I think it actually works.  For one, it sets of the white beautifully.  It also point to the yellow light in the middle of the daisy.  Beautiful.  Upping to 8.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-03 20:06:37.</i></td>', 'Beautiful light on the daisy, great definition.  Not sure if the squarish (not square, duh!) crop complements the image.  I also think the yellow border doens''t work all that well, it takes away from the lightness of the flower on the shite background.   Thinking about the border, I think it actually works.  For one, it sets of the white beautifully.  It also point to the yellow light in the middle of the daisy.  Beautiful.  Upping to 8.', '2006-12-02 14:02:11.000000', '2006-12-03 20:06:37.000000', 1),
(3081775, 432077, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Love the idea, subject coming through the background.  ~8</td>', 'Beautiful!  Love the idea, subject coming through the background.  ~8', '2006-12-02 14:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081777, 431865, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Looks like an image you''d work on for a cookbook.  I''m not sure about the splash, it''s too much for this image I think.  Or, either concentrate on the splash or the still life.  ~6</td>', 'Good idea.  Looks like an image you''d work on for a cookbook.  I''m not sure about the splash, it''s too much for this image I think.  Or, either concentrate on the splash or the still life.  ~6', '2006-12-02 14:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081779, 432088, 5112, '<td valign="top">Awww!   The little monster really is cute!  Good entry.  ~7</td>', 'Awww!   The little monster really is cute!  Good entry.  ~7', '2006-12-02 14:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081780, 432078, 5112, '<td valign="top">I think, for this image to work, both pins would need to be in perfect focus, or, one of them would have to be way more out of focus.  Also, the background needs to be lighter.  And last, the placement of the pins leads the eyes out of the image (to the right) rather than into it to explore the possibilities.  I hope this helps.  ~4</td>', 'I think, for this image to work, both pins would need to be in perfect focus, or, one of them would have to be way more out of focus.  Also, the background needs to be lighter.  And last, the placement of the pins leads the eyes out of the image (to the right) rather than into it to explore the possibilities.  I hope this helps.  ~4', '2006-12-02 14:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3081782, 431639, 5112, '<td valign="top">The pink is beautiful, and the background is very white, but the flower is just floating there, no connection to anything.  ~4</td>', 'The pink is beautiful, and the background is very white, but the flower is just floating there, no connection to anything.  ~4', '2006-12-02 14:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
