(3083374, 432077, 5792, '<td valign="top">What a fine, fine image. Nicely setup and captured. Clever concept, nice use of the rule of thirds. Good in every way except the purity of the white background.</td>', 'What a fine, fine image. Nicely setup and captured. Clever concept, nice use of the rule of thirds. Good in every way except the purity of the white background.', '2006-12-03 11:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083385, 431411, 5792, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous glamor image. Composition, lighting and tonality are all top notch. You attention to detail is its strongest point. Though I''m not normally a sepia fan it seems to work well here. (or maybe this is muted color) DPC voters will see this as not having a pure white background and may vote is lower because of that.</td>', 'Gorgeous glamor image. Composition, lighting and tonality are all top notch. You attention to detail is its strongest point. Though I''m not normally a sepia fan it seems to work well here. (or maybe this is muted color) DPC voters will see this as not having a pure white background and may vote is lower because of that.', '2006-12-03 11:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083390, 430637, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, decent composition, nice offset from center for placement of your main subjects. The background has no pure whites and voters will fault this image for it. The shadow to the left f the leftmost bulb acts as a distraction</td>', 'Interesting concept, decent composition, nice offset from center for placement of your main subjects. The background has no pure whites and voters will fault this image for it. The shadow to the left f the leftmost bulb acts as a distraction', '2006-12-03 11:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083396, 431435, 5792, '<td valign="top">Brilliant in its simplicity and crop. The pink adds greatly to the composition.</td>', 'Brilliant in its simplicity and crop. The pink adds greatly to the composition.', '2006-12-03 11:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083402, 431266, 5792, '<td valign="top">Incredible composition and exceptional technical quality. Simply amazing portrait. Should be a ribbon contender if voters don''t nit pick it for a solid white background.</td>', 'Incredible composition and exceptional technical quality. Simply amazing portrait. Should be a ribbon contender if voters don''t nit pick it for a solid white background.', '2006-12-03 11:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083410, 431925, 5792, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what you are trying to say with this image, but it has high viewer interest and is very entertaining. Along with its nicely solid white background, this image should be a top contender.</td>', 'I have no idea what you are trying to say with this image, but it has high viewer interest and is very entertaining. Along with its nicely solid white background, this image should be a top contender.', '2006-12-03 11:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
