(3083476, 431882, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured floral image. The background is not pure white and that may hurt it with voters (as if being a flower won''t already. lol)<br/> <br/>Because of monitor differences sometimes it is difficult to obtain pure white. It appears solid white on your monitor when it really isn''t. The only way to know for sure is if your image editing software has a numeric display for the luminosity of individual points in the image (most do). In that case pure white will be displayed as 255 in all three RGB colors.</td>', 'Very nicely captured floral image. The background is not pure white and that may hurt it with voters (as if being a flower won''t already. lol) Because of monitor differences sometimes it is difficult to obtain pure white. It appears solid white on your monitor when it really isn''t. The only way to know for sure is if your image editing software has a numeric display for the luminosity of individual points in the image (most do). In that case pure white will be displayed as 255 in all three RGB colors.', '2006-12-03 12:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3083480, 431156, 5792, '<td valign="top">Like the tones and composition in this image very, very much. It is very well done and has a nice perspective on the watch. Unfortunately the background is not a pure white as specified in the challenge statement and some voters will fault you for it.</td>', 'Like the tones and composition in this image very, very much. It is very well done and has a nice perspective on the watch. Unfortunately the background is not a pure white as specified in the challenge statement and some voters will fault you for it.', '2006-12-03 12:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
