(3086043, 431880, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5. If it were just a perfectly exposed, sharp photo of a glass of ale I would have given it a 4, but I gave you an extra point for the daring processing. You pushed it to the very edge of visibility, so that even though the rim and base are visible on your monitor, they are pretty much invisible on some of the voters'' monitors, including mine. And that explains the low score. The things I vote up for, other people vote down for.<br/> <br/>p.s. the reason I was voting this low in the first place is because I don''t like studio/product shots and I feel a photo should have a reason to exist other than fulfilling the challenge.<br/></td>', 'I gave this a 5. If it were just a perfectly exposed, sharp photo of a glass of ale I would have given it a 4, but I gave you an extra point for the daring processing. You pushed it to the very edge of visibility, so that even though the rim and base are visible on your monitor, they are pretty much invisible on some of the voters'' monitors, including mine. And that explains the low score. The things I vote up for, other people vote down for. p.s. the reason I was voting this low in the first place is because I don''t like studio/product shots and I feel a photo should have a reason to exist other than fulfilling the challenge.', '2006-12-04 09:26:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086060, 431308, 40683, '<td valign="top">I gave this my highest score and really thought that it would ribbon.  Excellent shot!</td>', 'I gave this my highest score and really thought that it would ribbon.  Excellent shot!', '2006-12-04 09:31:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086068, 431842, 66384, '<td valign="top">From what I can gather by looking at other entries, I think these LOW shots do better when the background is absolutes pure white. This background (and mine too, which scored badly) looks a bit gray, even thought it is actually white. I think that may be what hurt your score. BTW, I like the idea.</td>', 'From what I can gather by looking at other entries, I think these LOW shots do better when the background is absolutes pure white. This background (and mine too, which scored badly) looks a bit gray, even thought it is actually white. I think that may be what hurt your score. BTW, I like the idea.', '2006-12-04 09:33:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086070, 431402, 28532, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!!  This is just adorable!!!  Congrats on placing top 20!!</td>', 'Awesome shot!!  This is just adorable!!!  Congrats on placing top 20!!', '2006-12-04 09:33:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086076, 432061, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6, which was pretty high in this challenge. It has lovely curves and I like how it blends into the white (but that blending probably cost you with other voters). I didn''t vote it higher because I''m shell-shocked. :) I see so many of these shell photos, but yours is one of the better ones. Your composition isn''t bad, but it doesn''t add interest, either.</td>', 'I gave this a 6, which was pretty high in this challenge. It has lovely curves and I like how it blends into the white (but that blending probably cost you with other voters). I didn''t vote it higher because I''m shell-shocked. :) I see so many of these shell photos, but yours is one of the better ones. Your composition isn''t bad, but it doesn''t add interest, either.', '2006-12-04 09:36:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086095, 431672, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot - the sweep to the curve and finally the curl ending in the sharp point. Interesting how difficult it is to make something so seemingly simple. Beautiful.</td>', 'I like this one a lot - the sweep to the curve and finally the curl ending in the sharp point. Interesting how difficult it is to make something so seemingly simple. Beautiful.', '2006-12-04 09:40:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086140, 432061, 57229, '<td valign="top">There''s a sort of genre to white (pale) on white photographs, in which the  foreground object needs to be sharp and the background needs to be clean. (My entry doesn''t comply with any of this, NB). This gets very close to it. I''d agree with a few comments that would have the shell a bit sharper, etc, etc, but the subject and composition are really good. I gave it 7.</td>', 'There''s a sort of genre to white (pale) on white photographs, in which the  foreground object needs to be sharp and the background needs to be clean. (My entry doesn''t comply with any of this, NB). This gets very close to it. I''d agree with a few comments that would have the shell a bit sharper, etc, etc, but the subject and composition are really good. I gave it 7.', '2006-12-04 10:04:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086146, 431885, 30982, '<td valign="top">A low score for a very creative (and pretty well executed) entry, but you got a great comment from Ursula and your Suck teammates approve, so the score is essentially meaningless.  I got a kick out of it, anyway.</td>', 'A low score for a very creative (and pretty well executed) entry, but you got a great comment from Ursula and your Suck teammates approve, so the score is essentially meaningless.  I got a kick out of it, anyway.', '2006-12-04 10:06:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086148, 430689, 57229, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to vote on this one. It''s a lovely picture and it''s under-rated in the voting. Guess the lace should have been whiter. Could have put it on a glass table and back-lit it? I suspect conspiracy against novices is at the heart of this disgracefully discriminatory voting though. Take heart - it is very unlikely that we will get any greener or suck any more :) Great shot.</td>', 'I didn''t get to vote on this one. It''s a lovely picture and it''s under-rated in the voting. Guess the lace should have been whiter. Could have put it on a glass table and back-lit it? I suspect conspiracy against novices is at the heart of this disgracefully discriminatory voting though. Take heart - it is very unlikely that we will get any greener or suck any more :) Great shot.', '2006-12-04 10:08:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086151, 432061, 30982, '<td valign="top">I, too, like how it fades into the background.  This isn''t always a plus on DPC, but to me it does work on some photos - this is one of them.  I do have agree that the subject of the photo (a shell) appeared a whole lot in this challenge and may have overwhelmed voters a bit.  I also agree with Jeff that this would make a very nice notecard.</td>', 'I, too, like how it fades into the background.  This isn''t always a plus on DPC, but to me it does work on some photos - this is one of them.  I do have agree that the subject of the photo (a shell) appeared a whole lot in this challenge and may have overwhelmed voters a bit.  I also agree with Jeff that this would make a very nice notecard.', '2006-12-04 10:09:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086153, 432018, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Lovely slant, curve, and color to the eye. Seems to be what light on white is all about. I agree with some of the comments that the skin tone is not the best. And I think it might work better if the top were cropped to just above the eyebrow, eliminating the dark line of hair.</td>', 'Great idea. Lovely slant, curve, and color to the eye. Seems to be what light on white is all about. I agree with some of the comments that the skin tone is not the best. And I think it might work better if the top were cropped to just above the eyebrow, eliminating the dark line of hair.', '2006-12-04 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086165, 431087, 34763, '<td valign="top">Most excellent, if only the single troll vote was dropped like it should have you would have been on the front page where it deserves. Beautiful!</td>', 'Most excellent, if only the single troll vote was dropped like it should have you would have been on the front page where it deserves. Beautiful!', '2006-12-04 10:17:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086172, 431816, 66384, '<td valign="top">This really is a lovely capture of a lovely subject. I think the contrast and shadows are perfect. The lines and textures are beautiful, and the subject is well defined. Great job and should have scored above 6.</td>', 'This really is a lovely capture of a lovely subject. I think the contrast and shadows are perfect. The lines and textures are beautiful, and the subject is well defined. Great job and should have scored above 6.', '2006-12-04 10:19:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086176, 430689, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think it''s white enough (I allow a pretty big range of "white") but I will agree that the eyelet of the case detracted from what you were trying to show as far as the size of the figurine.  As far as tabletop photography, I don''t have lights either.  Natural light from the window can be your friend, and believe it or not, a piece of white posterboard reflects a great deal of soft light.  You can use the window as your primary source, and the white posterboard from the other side (probably at a bit of an angle) to create "fill" light.  I was kinda amazed how well it works.</td>', 'I think it''s white enough (I allow a pretty big range of "white") but I will agree that the eyelet of the case detracted from what you were trying to show as far as the size of the figurine.  As far as tabletop photography, I don''t have lights either.  Natural light from the window can be your friend, and believe it or not, a piece of white posterboard reflects a great deal of soft light.  You can use the window as your primary source, and the white posterboard from the other side (probably at a bit of an angle) to create "fill" light.  I was kinda amazed how well it works.', '2006-12-04 10:20:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086182, 431096, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very awesome concept.</td>', 'Very awesome concept.', '2006-12-04 10:21:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086184, 432065, 63244, '<td valign="top">This was one of my absolute faves. Congrats on your ribbon. Beautiful!!</td>', 'This was one of my absolute faves. Congrats on your ribbon. Beautiful!!', '2006-12-04 10:21:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086192, 430896, 63244, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I knew when I first saw this it would ribbon.  You got my 10.</td>', 'Gorgeous! I knew when I first saw this it would ribbon.  You got my 10.', '2006-12-04 10:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086194, 432091, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  You got an RKT comment - that beats score or ribbon any day!  I love the part about the absurdity of the thumb, too.  I was one of your 6''s.  I thought it different enough to warrant consideration of more than just "eh".  The more I look at it, the more I like it, but not as much as some of your other efforts.</td>', 'Heh!  You got an RKT comment - that beats score or ribbon any day!  I love the part about the absurdity of the thumb, too.  I was one of your 6''s.  I thought it different enough to warrant consideration of more than just "eh".  The more I look at it, the more I like it, but not as much as some of your other efforts.', '2006-12-04 10:25:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086201, 431433, 57229, '<td valign="top"><i>"It was hard to get the cat to stay in the light box."</i> <br/> <br/>Tell me about it. I have cats charging around all over the place (except when I''m not trying to take their pictures, of course), so I just fire off millions of shots in the hopes that one or another might turn out half-way decent. This is a great set-up and great capture. It''s one of the ones I didn''t vote on and it scored somewhere up in a rarified atmosphere to which I cannot easily adjust, but I''ll swear it was well worth it, congrats.</td>', '"It was hard to get the cat to stay in the light box."  Tell me about it. I have cats charging around all over the place (except when I''m not trying to take their pictures, of course), so I just fire off millions of shots in the hopes that one or another might turn out half-way decent. This is a great set-up and great capture. It''s one of the ones I didn''t vote on and it scored somewhere up in a rarified atmosphere to which I cannot easily adjust, but I''ll swear it was well worth it, congrats.', '2006-12-04 10:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086202, 431755, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh!  That was yours!  I remember it well from the Challenge and was impressed with the really nice lighting.<br/> <br/>Good one.</td>', 'Oh!  That was yours!  I remember it well from the Challenge and was impressed with the really nice lighting. Good one.', '2006-12-04 10:27:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086204, 431672, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very simple, good execution!</td>', 'Very nice, very simple, good execution!', '2006-12-04 10:28:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086214, 431925, 14476, '<td valign="top">Now, that was a strange image!  Glad to see some DPCers "got it".  Beautifully photographed.</td>', 'Now, that was a strange image!  Glad to see some DPCers "got it".  Beautifully photographed.', '2006-12-04 10:30:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086215, 431433, 66384, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9. I''m not partial to pet pictures, but this is an exception. This is a true animal portrait, and you have done a great job of capturing a white animal without blowing out the detail. I like the way the fur dissolves into the white background. The pink nose and ears are perfect for this challenge, and the eyes provide the wow factor. Too bad about the tip of the right ear.</td>', 'I gave this a 9. I''m not partial to pet pictures, but this is an exception. This is a true animal portrait, and you have done a great job of capturing a white animal without blowing out the detail. I like the way the fur dissolves into the white background. The pink nose and ears are perfect for this challenge, and the eyes provide the wow factor. Too bad about the tip of the right ear.', '2006-12-04 10:30:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086223, 431227, 14476, '<td valign="top">Jeff, very nice use of shading here to bring out patterns and shapes.  Really nice composition on top of everything else.</td>', 'Jeff, very nice use of shading here to bring out patterns and shapes.  Really nice composition on top of everything else.', '2006-12-04 10:32:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086224, 431955, 30982, '<td valign="top">How to avoid the harsh light syndrome?  I''m still working on that myself - sometimes I like my light harsh.  For this shot, though, I think it would have been more effective if the light were indeed more diffuse and softer, and if you''d come in a lot closer to the tips of the pencils - the empty space here just feels too empty to me.  For softer light, try using a sheer fabric of some kind, or pointing the light at a white posterboard and reflecting that back onto your subject.  It will require a slower shutter speed, requiring a tripod, but can be worth the effort.</td>', 'How to avoid the harsh light syndrome?  I''m still working on that myself - sometimes I like my light harsh.  For this shot, though, I think it would have been more effective if the light were indeed more diffuse and softer, and if you''d come in a lot closer to the tips of the pencils - the empty space here just feels too empty to me.  For softer light, try using a sheer fabric of some kind, or pointing the light at a white posterboard and reflecting that back onto your subject.  It will require a slower shutter speed, requiring a tripod, but can be worth the effort.', '2006-12-04 10:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086229, 432018, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''d love to tell you this sucks, but it really doesn''t.  I like the blown skintones and the focus on the eye - quite captivating.</td>', 'I''d love to tell you this sucks, but it really doesn''t.  I like the blown skintones and the focus on the eye - quite captivating.', '2006-12-04 10:34:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086232, 431908, 14476, '<td valign="top">Caleb!  It''s so darned hard to photograph bubbles - especially against a white background.  And you did it perfectly. Really nice image.  Sorry it didn''t score higher, but I''m glad to have a chance to look at it again.</td>', 'Caleb!  It''s so darned hard to photograph bubbles - especially against a white background.  And you did it perfectly. Really nice image.  Sorry it didn''t score higher, but I''m glad to have a chance to look at it again.', '2006-12-04 10:35:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086240, 431880, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can see all of the glass on my laptop - this monitor is excellent at high-end details.  I suspect I''d be one of those who couldn''t see all of it if I were using my home monitor, which is excellent at the low end.  Still, I think it met the challenge - it''s definitely pale ale on white!</td>', 'I can see all of the glass on my laptop - this monitor is excellent at high-end details.  I suspect I''d be one of those who couldn''t see all of it if I were using my home monitor, which is excellent at the low end.  Still, I think it met the challenge - it''s definitely pale ale on white!', '2006-12-04 10:38:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086250, 431433, 30982, '<td valign="top">This one did not suck.  In fact, this is a gorgeous shot of a gorgeous animal!  Excellent control of the exposure to keep good levels of detail in the fur - that''s hard to do with cats in general, harder with white cats.  Excellent shot, great score!</td>', 'This one did not suck.  In fact, this is a gorgeous shot of a gorgeous animal!  Excellent control of the exposure to keep good levels of detail in the fur - that''s hard to do with cats in general, harder with white cats.  Excellent shot, great score!', '2006-12-04 10:40:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086260, 432090, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot - love the softness to it (though I suspect many interpreted that as "out of focus" - and you''re not even on that team).  The eyes are incredible - great job bringing those out, though having a model with such gorgeous eyes does help!</td>', 'I like this one a lot - love the softness to it (though I suspect many interpreted that as "out of focus" - and you''re not even on that team).  The eyes are incredible - great job bringing those out, though having a model with such gorgeous eyes does help!', '2006-12-04 10:43:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086271, 431842, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely set up and good DOF.  Whether the background is pure white or not - eh, matters not to me.  I will say I''m not a huge fan of the "set up" shot (even though I''m guilty as well), but this is pretty well done for what it is.  Probably should have done a Christmas theme, though... :-)</td>', 'Nicely set up and good DOF.  Whether the background is pure white or not - eh, matters not to me.  I will say I''m not a huge fan of the "set up" shot (even though I''m guilty as well), but this is pretty well done for what it is.  Probably should have done a Christmas theme, though... :-)', '2006-12-04 10:45:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086281, 431411, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, you so totally don''t suck.  This is magnificent!  I like the unease created by the wrong orientation; the softness works well for me; and I like the composition very much.  Keep this up and we''ll kick you out of the suck league!  (Not really - you''ve got the right attitude even if you are darn good with the camera.)</td>', 'Oh, you so totally don''t suck.  This is magnificent!  I like the unease created by the wrong orientation; the softness works well for me; and I like the composition very much.  Keep this up and we''ll kick you out of the suck league!  (Not really - you''ve got the right attitude even if you are darn good with the camera.)', '2006-12-04 10:47:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086283, 431087, 30608, '<td valign="top">Great finish Sandy! This also helped bump your average vote received of all your challenge entries closer to that 6.0 mark!! Just a couple more to go like this shot, and you''ll be there.</td>', 'Great finish Sandy! This also helped bump your average vote received of all your challenge entries closer to that 6.0 mark!! Just a couple more to go like this shot, and you''ll be there.', '2006-12-04 10:48:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086294, 432082, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting that both the new Suck members chose to use a disconcerting rotation - means you''ve joined the right team!  I love your explanation - I, too, use high tech stuff like you do.  Chairs, drapes, hangers, bottles - all can be used in very creative ways to hold props, lights... those fools with full light sets don''t know what they''re missing.<br/> <br/>Anyway, on my laptop monitor, which shows very great detail at the high end, I can see a lot of noise in the threads, both actual and reflected, which means something with respect to processing, I''m sure... too light, maybe?</td>', 'Interesting that both the new Suck members chose to use a disconcerting rotation - means you''ve joined the right team!  I love your explanation - I, too, use high tech stuff like you do.  Chairs, drapes, hangers, bottles - all can be used in very creative ways to hold props, lights... those fools with full light sets don''t know what they''re missing. Anyway, on my laptop monitor, which shows very great detail at the high end, I can see a lot of noise in the threads, both actual and reflected, which means something with respect to processing, I''m sure... too light, maybe?', '2006-12-04 10:52:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086327, 432108, 43031, '<td valign="top">Ha! I was wrong. I so thought that <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=35357" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">strikeslip</a> had done another potty pic in tribute to his first LOW pic. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=249548" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/395/thumb/249548.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/395/thumb/249548.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/395/thumb/249548.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Ha! I was wrong. I so thought that  strikeslip had done another potty pic in tribute to his first LOW pic.  ', '2006-12-04 11:06:34.000000', NULL, 0),
