(3086463, 430266, 66384, '<td valign="top">I just love this image. I think it meets the challenge perfectly! I gave it a 10 and think it should have scored higher overall. The lighting is what first attracts me to the shot, and then the composition holds me there. I like combination of the straight (radiant) lines of the flower and the curved lines of the curled ribbons, and the very soft color of the yellow center. Congratulations on a lovely entry.</td>', 'I just love this image. I think it meets the challenge perfectly! I gave it a 10 and think it should have scored higher overall. The lighting is what first attracts me to the shot, and then the composition holds me there. I like combination of the straight (radiant) lines of the flower and the curved lines of the curled ribbons, and the very soft color of the yellow center. Congratulations on a lovely entry.', '2006-12-04 12:31:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3086470, 432105, 66384, '<td valign="top">Gave this a 10. Don''t know what to say except "BEAUTIFUL"!</td>', 'Gave this a 10. Don''t know what to say except "BEAUTIFUL"!', '2006-12-04 12:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
