(3086480, 430896, 50034, '<td valign="top">This young lady has a rare &amp; exquisite beauty at her tender age!  The wonderful tonality between eyes and Christmas ornament highlights this fact with finesse &amp; strong persona!  You are most blessed to be part of such a unique &amp; splendid portrait!   :)<br/> <br/>Congratulations to a World-Class photographer!  Much success to a model with <b><i>apparent</i> promise</b>!  :)<br/> <br/>10!!!!  Most certainly shows!  :)</td>', 'This young lady has a rare & exquisite beauty at her tender age!  The wonderful tonality between eyes and Christmas ornament highlights this fact with finesse & strong persona!  You are most blessed to be part of such a unique & splendid portrait!   :) Congratulations to a World-Class photographer!  Much success to a model with apparent promise!  :) 10!!!!  Most certainly shows!  :)', '2006-12-04 12:41:52.000000', NULL, 0),
