(3086713, 431610, 67841, '<td valign="top">Yeah, shoot - I gave this one of the few 10s I handed out in this challenge &amp; I usually vote down baby shots!  Well, congrats anyway!</td>', 'Yeah, shoot - I gave this one of the few 10s I handed out in this challenge & I usually vote down baby shots!  Well, congrats anyway!', '2006-12-04 14:32:06.000000', NULL, 0),
