(3086728, 431649, 67841, '<td valign="top">I only gave three 10s in this challenge &amp; your submission got one.  This was a very tough challenge &amp; what I assume some nitpicked over I found made it stand out from the others - congrats!</td>', 'I only gave three 10s in this challenge & your submission got one.  This was a very tough challenge & what I assume some nitpicked over I found made it stand out from the others - congrats!', '2006-12-04 14:36:05.000000', NULL, 0),
