(3086742, 431649, 64929, '<td valign="top">I gave this a ''9'' - my favorite flower entry (besides my own - tee hee!) Bravo!  Well done!</td>', 'I gave this a ''9'' - my favorite flower entry (besides my own - tee hee!) Bravo!  Well done!', '2006-12-04 14:40:59.000000', NULL, 0),
