(3087171, 429805, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh you did GREAT with this one!  As soon as I saw it in the challenge I just loved it. . .but I''m so dumb and thought she was a "he". Sometimes it''s hard to tell at that age, but now. . of course. . she looks the epitome if feminine and beautiful!  <br/> <br/>This was one of my favorites!  You did so well at capturing her little personality!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh you did GREAT with this one!  As soon as I saw it in the challenge I just loved it. . .but I''m so dumb and thought she was a "he". Sometimes it''s hard to tell at that age, but now. . of course. . she looks the epitome if feminine and beautiful!   This was one of my favorites!  You did so well at capturing her little personality! ', '2006-12-04 17:16:36.000000', NULL, 0),
