(3087725, 432106, 22301, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by goodman:</b></div><hr/><i> i think its a good idea, great hands btw.<br/> <br/>just the hotspot on the forehead that spoilt this image. </i></td></tr></table> The hotspot I think came from my editing :(, oh well I did the whole thing in about 45 min and I am glad you guys liked the premise.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-04 22:34:23.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by goodman: i think its a good idea, great hands btw. just the hotspot on the forehead that spoilt this image.  The hotspot I think came from my editing :(, oh well I did the whole thing in about 45 min and I am glad you guys liked the premise.', '2006-12-04 21:53:36.000000', '2006-12-04 22:34:23.000000', 0),
(3087733, 432063, 69246, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The flower has a distinct texture that brings out details that the eye wouldn''t really pick up. Further sharpening on the stamen would have added the extra depth that is otherwise pulled in by the petal. The photos definately makes me think I can "feel" the flower.</td>', 'Very nice. The flower has a distinct texture that brings out details that the eye wouldn''t really pick up. Further sharpening on the stamen would have added the extra depth that is otherwise pulled in by the petal. The photos definately makes me think I can "feel" the flower.', '2006-12-04 21:58:59.000000', NULL, 0),
