(3092292, 431885, 57229, '<td valign="top">I seem to have started out on a vein of conceptual pics. The idea is better than the execution here. I tried to print the poem out on toilet paper, but that led to some time spent with a variety of utensils to clear all the little bits out of the printer before I could use it again. Still n all, it met with appreciation, not least from the Suck tribe. That''s about the accolade we''re looking for. Thanks :)</td>', 'I seem to have started out on a vein of conceptual pics. The idea is better than the execution here. I tried to print the poem out on toilet paper, but that led to some time spent with a variety of utensils to clear all the little bits out of the printer before I could use it again. Still n all, it met with appreciation, not least from the Suck tribe. That''s about the accolade we''re looking for. Thanks :)', '2006-12-06 09:52:14.000000', NULL, 0),
