(3093418, 431852, 65495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by shamer:</b></div><hr/><i> Maybe I was wrong, but I took this to be a bit of a joke &amp; after all the flowery stuff in this challenge I started thinking of it as a political protest, either way I gave you a 5 for standing out! LOL </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sweet, thanks. I actually love light on white, love pp, this however was some sort of protest as I did no processing, I got one comment "high marks for cleaning skills". The background used - projection screen - creates the impression of noise. Thanks again for the 5. Watch for my next entry. LOL</td>', 'Originally posted by shamer: Maybe I was wrong, but I took this to be a bit of a joke & after all the flowery stuff in this challenge I started thinking of it as a political protest, either way I gave you a 5 for standing out! LOL   Sweet, thanks. I actually love light on white, love pp, this however was some sort of protest as I did no processing, I got one comment "high marks for cleaning skills". The background used - projection screen - creates the impression of noise. Thanks again for the 5. Watch for my next entry. LOL', '2006-12-06 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
