(3095361, 431610, 67145, '<td valign="top">i was interested to see how this shot went in the challenge, coz i actually remembered it from when i voted =10, and i''m pretty amazed that it didnt get in at least the top 10 ... <br/>there are actually rules for voting and one of the rules is that ppl ''may not vote in a manner that suggests an intent to disrupt the voting system'' ... i''d say that in plain english that means that we should give the entry a ''reasonable'' vote ..... i cant imagine that anyone voting on your entry was being reasonable when they gave you a 1, 2, or a 3 ... of course ppl can have different likes and dislikes and baby photos may not be to some ppl''s taste ... so from 4 up you''d have to consider that ... <br/> <br/>i checked out your portfolio and profile and it looks as tho you are much to young to be even holding a camera, let alone taking such great shots ...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-07 05:03:59.</i></td>', 'i was interested to see how this shot went in the challenge, coz i actually remembered it from when i voted =10, and i''m pretty amazed that it didnt get in at least the top 10 ... there are actually rules for voting and one of the rules is that ppl ''may not vote in a manner that suggests an intent to disrupt the voting system'' ... i''d say that in plain english that means that we should give the entry a ''reasonable'' vote ..... i cant imagine that anyone voting on your entry was being reasonable when they gave you a 1, 2, or a 3 ... of course ppl can have different likes and dislikes and baby photos may not be to some ppl''s taste ... so from 4 up you''d have to consider that ...  i checked out your portfolio and profile and it looks as tho you are much to young to be even holding a camera, let alone taking such great shots ...', '2006-12-07 05:03:30.000000', '2006-12-07 05:03:59.000000', 0),
