(3101735, 431945, 1717, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bucket:</b></div><hr/><i> ok technically sound...<br/>but as a friend and admirer I have to ask you not to shoot like this again...<br/>why..because you have always brought things to life, and allowed me to view them through your eyes..<br/>and you give a part of yourself to your work...<br/>I don''t see you in this shot..<br/>you are a skilled photographer and this is well done..but you are nowhere to be found... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>you are absolutely right!  there is no "me" in this shot at all.  i shot strictly for the challenge which i rarely ever do.  i put no emotion in this pic and it''s way too cold and sterile for my tastes.  wanted to help out my WPL team, though. :)  <br/> <br/>thank you for always noticing my work and for sharing your feelings about this shot.  i promise...no more pics like this. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by bucket: ok technically sound...but as a friend and admirer I have to ask you not to shoot like this again...why..because you have always brought things to life, and allowed me to view them through your eyes..and you give a part of yourself to your work...I don''t see you in this shot..you are a skilled photographer and this is well done..but you are nowhere to be found...   you are absolutely right!  there is no "me" in this shot at all.  i shot strictly for the challenge which i rarely ever do.  i put no emotion in this pic and it''s way too cold and sterile for my tastes.  wanted to help out my WPL team, though. :)   thank you for always noticing my work and for sharing your feelings about this shot.  i promise...no more pics like this. :)', '2006-12-09 03:30:49.000000', NULL, 0),
